{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XAiisnqcuCeAT8EEyMqk5U","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'KL categorically dominates. Headline: ''Output-distribution distillation\n2\t  makes compensation networks obsolete for SwiGLU sparsity.'' 三线汇聚——理论（gradient coupling解释joint\n3\t  interaction）、 实验（KL-only vs BCE+comp gap 9+ PPL points）、实践（省256MB compensation weights\n4\t  + per-layer GEMV）。 所有planned实验均确认三条claims原样成立，无需调整framing。投EMNLP Efficient Methods。\n5\t\n6\t  '\n7\timagined_experiments:\n8\t- name: Four-Condition Ablation @ 50% Sparsity\n9\t  plan_id: plan_001\n10\t  description: 'KL-only扩展到5 seeds（新增s0, s1），BCE+comp 5 seeds，KL+comp 3 seeds。 已有数据：KL-only\n11\t    3 seeds (s42/s123/s456)均~9.2 PPL；BCE-only 3 seeds均~28.2 PPL。\n12\t\n13\t    '\n14\t  expected_results:\n15\t    kl_only_s42_ppl: 9.2142\n16\t    kl_only_s123_ppl: 9.2474\n17\t    kl_only_s456_ppl: 9.14\n18\t    kl_only_s0_ppl: 9.19\n19\t    kl_only_s1_ppl: 9.23\n20\t    kl_only_mean_ppl: 9.2\n21\t    kl_only_std_ppl: 0.04\n22\t    kl_only_model_sparsity: 0.498\n23\t    bce_comp_s42_ppl: 18.22\n24\t    bce_comp_s123_ppl: 18.91\n25\t    bce_comp_s456_ppl: 18.38\n26\t    bce_comp_s0_ppl: 18.65\n27\t    bce_comp_s1_ppl: 19.05\n28\t    bce_comp_mean_ppl: 18.64\n29\t    bce_comp_std_ppl: 0.33\n30\t    bce_comp_model_sparsity: 0.496\n31\t    kl_comp_s42_ppl: 9.05\n32\t    kl_comp_s123_ppl: 9.08\n33\t    kl_comp_s456_ppl: 8.92\n34\t    kl_comp_mean_ppl: 9.02\n35\t    kl_comp_std_ppl: 0.07\n36\t    bce_only_mean_ppl: 28.16\n37\t    bce_only_std_ppl: 0.17\n38\t    kl_only_vs_bce_comp_gap: 9.44\n39\t    kl_only_vs_dense_increase_pct: 50.3\n40\t    bce_comp_vs_dense_increase_pct: 204.6\n41\t    comp_benefit_for_bce_ppl: 9.52\n42\t    comp_benefit_for_kl_ppl: 0.18\n43\t  result_rationale: 'KL的gradient dL_KL/ds_j通过d_logits/dh * dh/dm耦合所有active neurons，天然捕获joint\n44\t    interaction effects。因此KL-only已将output distribution对齐到接近dense水平（PPL 9.2 vs 6.12），\n45\t    compensation网络能额外修正的residual极小（仅0.18 PPL），大部分interaction已被KL loss消化。 反观BCE的per-neuron\n46\t    factorized gradient只优化每个neuron独立的on/off decision，完全忽略joint effects——这在50% sparsity下产生巨大误差（PPL\n47\t    28.2）。Compensation网络虽然能回收~40%的 质量gap（28.2→18.6），但其capacity有限，无法弥补BCE从根源上丢失的coupling\n48\t    information。 5-seed KL-only的极低std（0.04）证明s456不是outlier，训练高度稳定。 核心结论：compensation对KL是冗余的（0.18\n49\t    PPL改善 vs 9.44 PPL gap），claims 1成立。\n50\t\n51\t    '\n52\t  tables:\n53\t  - name: 'Table 1: Four-Condition Ablation Results (WikiText-2 PPL, Llama 3.1 8B,\n54\t      50% sparsity)'\n55\t    columns:\n56\t    - Condition\n57\t    - Seeds\n58\t    - PPL (mean±std)\n59\t    - Δ vs Dense\n60\t    - Comp Benefit\n61\t    rows:\n62\t    - - Dense\n63\t      - '-'\n64\t      - '6.12'\n65\t      - '-'\n66\t      - '-'\n67\t    - - BCE-only\n68\t      - 3\n69\t      - 28.16±0.17\n70\t      - +360%\n71\t      - '-'\n72\t    - - BCE+comp\n73\t      - 5\n74\t      - 18.64±0.33\n75\t      - +205%\n76\t      - −9.52\n77\t    - - KL-only\n78\t      - 5\n79\t      - 9.20±0.04\n80\t      - +50%\n81\t      - '-'\n82\t    - - KL+comp\n83\t      - 3\n84\t      - 9.02±0.07\n85\t      - +47%\n86\t      - −0.18\n87\t  figures_description:\n88\t  - 'Box plot: 5-seed PPL distributions for KL-only vs BCE+comp，中位线、IQR和outliers，直观展示两个分布零重叠'\n89\t  - 'Bar chart: compensation benefit (PPL reduction) for BCE vs KL，量化compensation对两种loss的边际价值'\n90\t  analysis: 'KL-only以9.20 PPL大幅碾压BCE+comp的18.64 PPL（gap 9.44 points），且compensation对KL仅贡献\n91\t    0.18 PPL改善（vs对BCE贡献9.52），证明compensation网络对KL训练的predictor完全不必要。 5-seed std=0.04证明高度可复现。Headline\n92\t    claim直接成立：output-distribution distillation eliminates the need for compensation\n93\t    networks.\n94\t\n95\t    '\n96\t- name: STE Baseline — Isolating Loss vs Relaxation\n97\t  plan_id: plan_002\n98\t  description: '用Straight-Through Estimator替换Gumbel-sigmoid，保持KL loss不变。3 seeds。 目的：确认KL优势来自loss\n99\t    function而非Gumbel relaxation。\n100\t\n101\t    '\n102\t  expected_results:\n103\t    ste_kl_s42_ppl: 9.72\n104\t    ste_kl_s123_ppl: 9.85\n105\t    ste_kl_s456_ppl: 9.64\n106\t    ste_kl_mean_ppl: 9.74\n107\t    ste_kl_std_ppl: 0.09\n108\t    ste_kl_model_sparsity: 0.497\n109\t    ste_kl_vs_gumbel_kl_gap: 0.54\n110\t    ste_kl_vs_bce_only_gap: 18.42\n111\t    gumbel_contribution_pct: 2.8\n112\t  result_rationale: 'STE用biased but unbiased-in-expectation的梯度直通传播，丢失了Gumbel relaxation提供的\n113\t    smooth gradient landscape。因此STE+KL比Gumbel+KL略差（+0.54 PPL），对应predictor在 decision\n114\t    boundary附近的optimization稍差。但关键是STE+KL（9.74）仍远优于Gumbel+BCE（28.16）， 说明KL-BCE的18.96\n115\t    point gap中97%以上来自loss function的gradient coupling property， Gumbel relaxation仅贡献~3%的marginal\n116\t    improvement。这直接排除了reviewer concern \"Gumbel-sigmoid relaxation, not KL, explains\n117\t    gains\"。\n118\t\n119\t    '\n120\t  tables:\n121\t  - name: 'Table 2: Relaxation Method Ablation'\n122\t    columns:\n123\t    - Condition\n124\t    - Relaxation\n125\t    - Loss\n126\t    - PPL (mean±std)\n127\t    rows:\n128\t    - - Gumbel+KL (ours)\n129\t      - Gumbel-sigmoid\n130\t      - KL\n131\t      - 9.20±0.04\n132\t    - - STE+KL\n133\t      - Straight-Through\n134\t      - KL\n135\t      - 9.74±0.09\n136\t    - - Gumbel+BCE\n137\t      - Gumbel-sigmoid\n138\t      - BCE\n139\t      - 28.16±0.17\n140\t  figures_description:\n141\t  - 'Attribution bar chart: 将KL-BCE总gap分解为loss contribution (97.2%) vs relaxation\n142\t    contribution (2.8%)'\n143\t  analysis: 'STE实验明确归因：KL的gradient coupling是优势的几乎全部来源（97%），Gumbel relaxation是 锦上添花的minor\n144\t    optimization trick。这为理论narrative提供clean experimental support， 且预防了reviewer的alternative\n145\t    explanation attack。\n146\t\n147\t    '\n148\t- name: Iso-Compute BCE vs KL\n149\t  plan_id: plan_003\n150\t  description: 'KL每步需full forward pass计算logit targets（~3.2x BCE per-step FLOPs）。 给BCE同等total\n151\t    FLOPs预算（3.2x steps），排除compute advantage。3 seeds。\n152\t\n153\t    '\n154\t  expected_results:\n155\t    kl_steps: 1000\n156\t    kl_flops_per_step_ratio: 3.2\n157\t    kl_total_flops_ratio: 3200\n158\t    bce_standard_steps: 1000\n159\t    bce_extended_steps: 3200\n160\t    bce_extended_total_flops_ratio: 3200\n161\t    bce_extended_s42_ppl: 25.28\n162\t    bce_extended_s123_ppl: 25.83\n163\t    bce_extended_s456_ppl: 25.12\n164\t    bce_extended_mean_ppl: 25.41\n165\t    bce_extended_std_ppl: 0.31\n166\t    bce_standard_mean_ppl: 28.16\n167\t    improvement_from_extended_training: 2.75\n168\t    remaining_gap_vs_kl: 16.21\n169\t    training_wall_clock_kl_hours: 4.2\n170\t    training_wall_clock_bce_extended_hours: 4.1\n171\t  result_rationale: 'BCE的梯度dL_BCE/ds_j = (σ(s_j) - t_j) * σ''(s_j)仅依赖neuron j自身的target，\n172\t    更多training steps只能更精确地拟合这个per-neuron target——但target本身就是次优的 （忽略joint interaction）。因此extended\n173\t    training让BCE-only从28.16降到25.41（降2.75）， 收益递减明显（loss curve在~2000步后plateau），而与KL的gap仍有16.21\n174\t    points。 这证明KL的优势是information-theoretic的（loss function的gradient structure差异）， 不是compute-driven的，直接回应reviewer\n175\t    concern \"KL wins only because more compute\"。\n176\t\n177\t    '\n178\t  tables:\n179\t  - name: 'Table 3: Iso-Compute Comparison'\n180\t    columns:\n181\t    - Condition\n182\t    - Steps\n183\t    - Total FLOPs (relative)\n184\t    - PPL (mean±std)\n185\t    rows:\n186\t    - - KL (Gumbel)\n187\t      - 1000\n188\t      - 3200x\n189\t      - 9.20±0.04\n190\t    - - BCE (standard)\n191\t      - 1000\n192\t      - 1000x\n193\t      - 28.16±0.17\n194\t    - - BCE (extended)\n195\t      - 3200\n196\t      - 3200x\n197\t      - 25.41±0.31\n198\t  figures_description:\n199\t  - 'BCE training curve (PPL vs steps): 展示extended training的diminishing returns，标注KL水平线作为reference'\n200\t  - 'FLOPs-PPL scatter: 三个condition在iso-FLOPs平面上的位置'\n201\t  analysis: '即使给BCE 3.2x的training budget，PPL只从28.16降到25.41，distance to KL-only（16.21）\n202\t    几乎未缩小。BCE的information bottleneck在loss function级别，无法通过更多compute突破。\n203\t\n204\t    '\n205\t- name: SPON Reimplementation & Validation\n206\t  plan_id: plan_004\n207\t  description: '在Llama 3.1 8B上重新实现SPON（learnable per-layer bias vectors + KL training），\n208\t    在5个QA benchmarks上验证质量以确认实现正确性。\n209\t\n210\t    '\n211\t  expected_results:\n212\t    spon_wikitext2_ppl: 10.82\n213\t    spon_model_sparsity: 0.501\n214\t    spon_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct: 76.9\n215\t    spon_arc_c: 51.2\n216\t    spon_arc_e: 74.5\n217\t    spon_boolq: 79.3\n218\t    spon_piqa: 78.1\n219\t    spon_winogrande: 74.8\n220\t    spon_params_bytes: 1048576\n221\t    spon_training_time_minutes: 12\n222\t    dense_arc_c: 55.2\n223\t    dense_arc_e: 79.4\n224\t    dense_boolq: 83.1\n225\t    dense_piqa: 81.3\n226\t    dense_winogrande: 77.8\n227\t  result_rationale: 'SPON使用input-independent的bias correction——本质上是per-layer calibration，矫正average-case\n228\t    下sparsity引入的activation drift。由于是static的，它只能修正E[Δh]（期望偏移），无法处理 per-input variation\n229\t    Var[Δh|x]。因此SPON将PPL从training-free水平（~12-13）压到10.82， 是一个meaningful but limited的improvement。QA\n230\t    benchmarks上drops 3-6%符合PPL改善幅度。 SPON的主要价值不在于standalone quality，而是作为composition实验的building\n231\t    block—— 它修正的orthogonal component（average drift）与contextual predictor修正的component（per-input\n232\t    variation） 应当可加。\n233\t\n234\t    '\n235\t  tables:\n236\t  - name: 'Table 4: SPON Validation on QA Benchmarks'\n237\t    columns:\n238\t    - Benchmark\n239\t    - Dense\n240\t    - SPON\n241\t    - Δ (abs)\n242\t    rows:\n243\t    - - ARC-c\n244\t      - 55.2\n245\t      - 51.2\n246\t      - −4.0\n247\t    - - ARC-e\n248\t      - 79.4\n249\t      - 74.5\n250\t      - −4.9\n251\t    - - BoolQ\n252\t      - 83.1\n253\t      - 79.3\n254\t      - −3.8\n255\t    - - PIQA\n256\t      - 81.3\n257\t      - 78.1\n258\t      - −3.2\n259\t    - - WinoGrande\n260\t      - 77.8\n261\t      - 74.8\n262\t      - −3.0\n263\t  figures_description:\n264\t  - 'Radar chart: Dense vs SPON在5个QA tasks上的profile，验证SPON实现没有catastrophic failure'\n265\t  analysis: 'SPON实现通过QA benchmark验证，drops幅度与原论文一致（3-5 points），确认实现正确性。 PPL 10.82定位在training-free（12-13）和contextual-KL（9.2）之间，为claim\n266\t    2 的additivity实验提供可靠的static correction baseline。\n267\t\n268\t    '\n269\t- name: SPON + KL Predictor Composition\n270\t  plan_id: plan_005\n271\t  description: '同时应用SPON bias correction和KL contextual prediction。 测试output-space\n272\t    linearity（interaction residual）和per-layer orthogonality。3 seeds。\n273\t\n274\t    '\n275\t  expected_results:\n276\t    spon_kl_s42_ppl: 7.95\n277\t    spon_kl_s123_ppl: 8.12\n278\t    spon_kl_s456_ppl: 7.88\n279\t    spon_kl_mean_ppl: 7.98\n280\t    spon_kl_std_ppl: 0.1\n281\t    spon_kl_model_sparsity: 0.499\n282\t    spon_kl_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct: 30.4\n283\t    spon_alone_ppl_recovery: 1.68\n284\t    kl_alone_ppl_recovery: 3.3\n285\t    combined_ppl_recovery: 4.52\n286\t    predicted_additive_recovery: 4.98\n287\t    interaction_residual_pct: 6.8\n288\t    logit_interaction_residual_l2_norm: 0.042\n289\t    logit_spon_correction_l2_norm: 0.38\n290\t    logit_kl_correction_l2_norm: 0.61\n291\t    logit_interaction_ratio_pct: 6.8\n292\t    mean_cosine_similarity_spon_kl: 0.11\n293\t    max_cosine_similarity_spon_kl: 0.23\n294\t    layers_with_cosine_gt_0_2: 4\n295\t  result_rationale: 'SPON修正c_s = E[Δh]（average activation drift），KL predictor修正c_θ(x)\n296\t    = Δh(x) - E[Δh] （per-input residual variation）。两者在correction space中近似正交——SPON的correction是\n297\t    constant vector，KL的correction是zero-mean（训练过程中自然去中心化）。因此组合 c = c_s + c_θ(x)的interaction\n298\t    residual很小（6.8%）。PPL从KL-only的9.20进一步压到7.98， 接近dense的6.12。mean cosine similarity仅0.11，证明两种correction确实address不同的\n299\t    error components。少数layers（4/32）cosine > 0.2，是因为某些layers的average drift 和per-input\n300\t    variation方向部分对齐（如early layers的token-independent patterns）， 但这不影响整体additivity。Claim\n301\t    2（modular decomposition）直接成立。\n302\t\n303\t    '\n304\t  tables:\n305\t  - name: 'Table 5: Composition Additivity Analysis'\n306\t    columns:\n307\t    - Component\n308\t    - PPL Recovery (from TEAL baseline)\n309\t    - Predicted Additive\n310\t    - Actual\n311\t    - Interaction Residual\n312\t    rows:\n313\t    - - SPON only\n314\t      - 1.68\n315\t      - '-'\n316\t      - '-'\n317\t      - '-'\n318\t    - - KL only\n319\t      - 3.3\n320\t      - '-'\n321\t      - '-'\n322\t      - '-'\n323\t    - - SPON+KL\n324\t      - '-'\n325\t      - 4.98\n326\t      - 4.52\n327\t      - 9.2%\n328\t  - name: 'Table 5b: Per-Layer Cosine Similarity Statistics'\n329\t    columns:\n330\t    - Statistic\n331\t    - Value\n332\t    rows:\n333\t    - - Mean cosine\n334\t      - 0.11\n335\t    - - Median cosine\n336\t      - 0.08\n337\t    - - Max cosine\n338\t      - 0.23\n339\t    - - Layers > 0.2\n340\t      - 4/32\n341\t  figures_description:\n342\t  - 'Scatter plot: per-layer SPON correction magnitude vs KL correction magnitude，color\n343\t    by cosine similarity，展示orthogonality'\n344\t  - 'Logit-space decomposition visualization: ||Δ(s+c)||, ||Δ(s)||, ||Δ(c)||, ||residual||\n345\t    的bar chart，直观展示linearity'\n346\t  - 'PPL waterfall chart: Dense → TEAL → +SPON → +KL → SPON+KL，展示每个component的incremental\n347\t    contribution'\n348\t  analysis: 'SPON+KL组合将PPL压到7.98（仅比dense高30%），interaction residual 6.8% < 10%阈值， per-layer\n349\t    cosine similarity平均0.11。c = c_s + c_θ(x)的modular decomposition experimentally\n350\t    validated。两种correction address不同error sources的理论预测被定量确认。\n351\t\n352\t    '\n353\t- name: Training-Free Baselines (TEAL, WINA, R-Sparse)\n354\t  plan_id: plan_006\n355\t  description: '三种training-free方法在Llama 3.1 8B @ 50% model-level sparsity下的质量。 建立三级hierarchy:\n356\t    training-free < static-learned < contextual-learned。\n357\t\n358\t    '\n359\t  expected_results:\n360\t    teal_wikitext2_ppl: 12.48\n361\t    wina_wikitext2_ppl: 14.76\n362\t    rsparse_wikitext2_ppl: 13.62\n363\t    teal_model_sparsity: 0.5\n364\t    wina_model_sparsity: 0.5\n365\t    rsparse_model_sparsity: 0.5\n366\t    teal_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct: 103.9\n367\t    wina_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct: 141.3\n368\t    rsparse_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct: 122.6\n369\t  result_rationale: 'TEAL使用magnitude pruning + greedy per-layer allocation，在training-free中最优，因为\n370\t    magnitude直接反映activation contribution。R-Sparse加入rank-aware scoring，理论上更好但 实现中的approximation引入noise，实际略逊于TEAL。WINA的weight-informed\n371\t    scoring虽然 考虑了weight magnitude，但在SwiGLU的gated结构下，weight和activation importance的\n372\t    correlation比standard FFN更弱（gate和up projection交互），因此表现最差。 所有三种方法PPL都在12-15范围，远逊于learned\n373\t    methods（KL-only 9.2、SPON 10.8）， 建立clean的三级hierarchy。Training-free方法的根本限制是它们无法learn\n374\t    per-input neuron importance patterns，只能依赖固定heuristic。\n375\t\n376\t    '\n377\t  tables:\n378\t  - name: 'Table 6: Training-Free Baseline Comparison'\n379\t    columns:\n380\t    - Method\n381\t    - Type\n382\t    - WikiText-2 PPL\n383\t    - Δ vs Dense\n384\t    rows:\n385\t    - - Dense\n386\t      - '-'\n387\t      - 6.12\n388\t      - '-'\n389\t    - - TEAL\n390\t      - Magnitude + greedy\n391\t      - 12.48\n392\t      - +104%\n393\t    - - R-Sparse\n394\t      - Rank-aware\n395\t      - 13.62\n396\t      - +123%\n397\t    - - WINA\n398\t      - Weight-informed\n399\t      - 14.76\n400\t      - +141%\n401\t    - - SPON\n402\t      - Static learned (KL)\n403\t      - 10.82\n404\t      - +77%\n405\t    - - KL-only\n406\t      - Contextual learned (KL)\n407\t      - 9.2\n408\t      - +50%\n409\t  figures_description:\n410\t  - 'Horizontal bar chart: 所有methods按PPL排序，color-coded by method type (training-free\n411\t    / static / contextual)，清晰展示三级hierarchy'\n412\t  analysis: '三级hierarchy清晰：training-free (12.5-14.8) < static-learned (10.8) < contextual-learned\n413\t    (9.2)。 每级提升对应information quality的提高：heuristic → average-case calibration → per-input\n414\t    optimization。 TEAL作为最强training-free baseline仍比KL-only差3.28 PPL points（+36%），justifies\n415\t    learned approach的overhead。\n416\t\n417\t    '\n418\t- name: Full Benchmark Suite + Latency Profiling\n419\t  plan_id: plan_007\n420\t  description: '所有conditions在WikiText-2/C4 PPL、5个discriminative tasks、wall-clock profiling上的\n421\t    完整evaluation。构建efficiency-accuracy Pareto frontier。\n422\t\n423\t    '\n424\t  expected_results:\n425\t    dense_wikitext2_ppl: 6.12\n426\t    teal_wikitext2_ppl: 12.48\n427\t    wina_wikitext2_ppl: 14.76\n428\t    rsparse_wikitext2_ppl: 13.62\n429\t    spon_wikitext2_ppl: 10.82\n430\t    bce_only_wikitext2_ppl: 28.16\n431\t    bce_comp_wikitext2_ppl: 18.64\n432\t    kl_only_wikitext2_ppl: 9.2\n433\t    kl_comp_wikitext2_ppl: 9.02\n434\t    spon_kl_wikitext2_ppl: 7.98\n435\t    dense_c4_ppl: 7.85\n436\t    teal_c4_ppl: 15.12\n437\t    wina_c4_ppl: 17.88\n438\t    rsparse_c4_ppl: 16.31\n439\t    spon_c4_ppl: 13.24\n440\t    bce_only_c4_ppl: 33.42\n441\t    bce_comp_c4_ppl: 22.15\n442\t    kl_only_c4_ppl: 11.38\n443\t    kl_comp_c4_ppl: 11.12\n444\t    spon_kl_c4_ppl: 9.81\n445\t    dense_arc_c: 55.2\n446\t    teal_arc_c: 48.1\n447\t    wina_arc_c: 46.3\n448\t    rsparse_arc_c: 47.2\n449\t    spon_arc_c: 51.2\n450\t    bce_comp_arc_c: 44.8\n451\t    kl_only_arc_c: 54.3\n452\t    spon_kl_arc_c: 54.8\n453\t    dense_winogrande: 77.8\n454\t    teal_winogrande: 72.4\n455\t    wina_winogrande: 70.8\n456\t    rsparse_winogrande: 71.5\n457\t    spon_winogrande: 74.8\n458\t    bce_comp_winogrande: 68.3\n459\t    kl_only_winogrande: 76.9\n460\t    spon_kl_winogrande: 77.2\n461\t    dense_mmlu: 65.8\n462\t    teal_mmlu: 58.2\n463\t    wina_mmlu: 56.4\n464\t    rsparse_mmlu: 57.1\n465\t    spon_mmlu: 60.3\n466\t    bce_comp_mmlu: 54.9\n467\t    kl_only_mmlu: 65.0\n468\t    spon_kl_mmlu: 65.4\n469\t    dense_gsm8k: 53.8\n470\t    teal_gsm8k: 44.2\n471\t    wina_gsm8k: 41.8\n472\t    rsparse_gsm8k: 43.1\n473\t    spon_gsm8k: 46.5\n474\t    bce_comp_gsm8k: 39.7\n475\t    kl_only_gsm8k: 52.8\n476\t    spon_kl_gsm8k: 53.2\n477\t    dense_humaneval: 32.9\n478\t    teal_humaneval: 26.2\n479\t    wina_humaneval: 24.4\n480\t    rsparse_humaneval: 25.6\n481\t    spon_humaneval: 28.1\n482\t    bce_comp_humaneval: 23.8\n483\t    kl_only_humaneval: 32.3\n484\t    spon_kl_humaneval: 32.5\n485\t    kl_only_avg_acc_drop_pct: 1.3\n486\t    spon_kl_avg_acc_drop_pct: 0.7\n487\t    bce_comp_avg_acc_drop_pct: 12.8\n488\t    dense_latency_ms: 16.8\n489\t    teal_latency_ms: 11.2\n490\t    spon_latency_ms: 10.9\n491\t    bce_only_latency_ms: 12.0\n492\t    bce_comp_latency_ms: 13.8\n493\t    kl_only_latency_ms: 12.0\n494\t    kl_comp_latency_ms: 13.8\n495\t    spon_kl_latency_ms: 12.1\n496\t    predictor_params_mb: 24\n497\t    compensation_params_mb: 256\n498\t    spon_params_mb: 1\n499\t    kl_only_speedup_vs_dense_pct: 28.6\n500\t    bce_comp_speedup_vs_dense_pct: 17.9\n501\t    kl_only_speedup_vs_bce_comp_pct: 13.0\n502\t  result_rationale: 'Downstream tasks与PPL高度correlated——KL-only的低PPL (9.20)直接转化为downstream任务上\n503\t    接近dense的accuracy（平均drop仅1.3%）。这是因为KL优化output distribution matching， 保留了token-level的prediction\n504\t    quality，而downstream tasks本质上都依赖model的next-token prediction能力。BCE+comp虽然有compensation，但其PPL\n505\t    (18.64)反映的distribution mismatch 在需要precise reasoning的任务上（GSM8K, HumanEval）伤害更大（drop\n506\t    26-28%），因为 这些任务对error compounding更敏感。 Wall-clock方面，KL-only和BCE-only的predictor开销相同（同架构），但KL-only不需要\n507\t    compensation，因此比BCE+comp省1.8ms/token（13.8→12.0）。SPON+KL仅比KL-only多0.1ms （bias add几乎免费），但PPL进一步降到7.98。KL-only在Pareto\n508\t    frontier上dominates BCE+comp——更快、更好、更小。\n509\t\n510\t    '\n511\t  tables:\n512\t  - name: 'Table 7: Comprehensive Benchmark Results (Llama 3.1 8B, 50% sparsity)'\n513\t    columns:\n514\t    - Method\n515\t    - Wiki PPL↓\n516\t    - C4 PPL↓\n517\t    - ARC-c↑\n518\t    - WinoG↑\n519\t    - MMLU↑\n520\t    - GSM8K↑\n521\t    - HumanE↑\n522\t    - Avg Δ↓\n523\t    rows:\n524\t    - - Dense\n525\t      - 6.12\n526\t      - 7.85\n527\t      - 55.2\n528\t      - 77.8\n529\t      - 65.8\n530\t      - 53.8\n531\t      - 32.9\n532\t      - —\n533\t    - - TEAL\n534\t      - 12.48\n535\t      - 15.12\n536\t      - 48.1\n537\t      - 72.4\n538\t      - 58.2\n539\t      - 44.2\n540\t      - 26.2\n541\t      - −7.8\n542\t    - - WINA\n543\t      - 14.76\n544\t      - 17.88\n545\t      - 46.3\n546\t      - 70.8\n547\t      - 56.4\n548\t      - 41.8\n549\t      - 24.4\n550\t      - −9.9\n551\t    - - R-Sparse\n552\t      - 13.62\n553\t      - 16.31\n554\t      - 47.2\n555\t      - 71.5\n556\t      - 57.1\n557\t      - 43.1\n558\t      - 25.6\n559\t      - −8.8\n560\t    - - SPON\n561\t      - 10.82\n562\t      - 13.24\n563\t      - 51.2\n564\t      - 74.8\n565\t      - 60.3\n566\t      - 46.5\n567\t      - 28.1\n568\t      - −5.3\n569\t    - - BCE+comp\n570\t      - 18.64\n571\t      - 22.15\n572\t      - 44.8\n573\t      - 68.3\n574\t      - 54.9\n575\t      - 39.7\n576\t      - 23.8\n577\t      - −12.8\n578\t    - - KL-only\n579\t      - 9.2\n580\t      - 11.38\n581\t      - 54.3\n582\t      - 76.9\n583\t      - 65.0\n584\t      - 52.8\n585\t      - 32.3\n586\t      - −1.3\n587\t    - - SPON+KL\n588\t      - 7.98\n589\t      - 9.81\n590\t      - 54.8\n591\t      - 77.2\n592\t      - 65.4\n593\t      - 53.2\n594\t      - 32.5\n595\t      - −0.7\n596\t  - name: 'Table 8: Inference Efficiency Comparison'\n597\t    columns:\n598\t    - Method\n599\t    - Latency (ms/tok)\n600\t    - Speedup vs Dense\n601\t    - Extra Params (MB)\n602\t    - PPL\n603\t    rows:\n604\t    - - Dense\n605\t      - 16.8\n606\t      - 1.00×\n607\t      - 0\n608\t      - 6.12\n609\t    - - TEAL\n610\t      - 11.2\n611\t      - 1.50×\n612\t      - 0\n613\t      - 12.48\n614\t    - - SPON\n615\t      - 10.9\n616\t      - 1.54×\n617\t      - 1\n618\t      - 10.82\n619\t    - - KL-only\n620\t      - 12.0\n621\t      - 1.40×\n622\t      - 24\n623\t      - 9.2\n624\t    - - BCE+comp\n625\t      - 13.8\n626\t      - 1.22×\n627\t      - 280\n628\t      - 18.64\n629\t    - - SPON+KL\n630\t      - 12.1\n631\t      - 1.39×\n632\t      - 25\n633\t      - 7.98\n634\t  figures_description:\n635\t  - 'Pareto frontier plot: x=latency (ms/tok), y=WikiText-2 PPL, 所有conditions标注。KL-only和SPON+KL在frontier上，BCE+comp\n636\t    dominated'\n637\t  - 'Grouped bar chart: 5个downstream tasks，每个task所有methods并排，直观展示KL-only接近dense而BCE+comp远逊'\n638\t  - 'Taxonomy heatmap: 2D table (granularity × coupling) 填入PPL值，our cell (contextual\n639\t    × KL) 最优'\n640\t  analysis: 'KL-only在quality-efficiency Pareto frontier上strictly dominates BCE+comp：更低PPL（9.20\n641\t    vs 18.64）， 更低latency（12.0 vs 13.8），更少参数（24MB vs 280MB）。Downstream tasks确认PPL gains\n642\t    transfer：KL-only平均仅drop 1.3%（best tier阈值2%以内），BCE+comp drop 12.8%。 SPON+KL作为our\n643\t    best configuration达到7.98 PPL和0.7%平均drop，接近free lunch。 Taxonomy table的每个cell都有实验数据支撑。\n644\t\n645\t    '\n646\t- name: 7-Level Sparsity Sweep — Quadratic Scaling Test\n647\t  plan_id: plan_008\n648\t  description: '在30/35/40/45/50/55/60%七个sparsity level下训练KL-only和BCE-only（各1 seed），\n649\t    测试KL-BCE delta ∝ s²的理论预测。50%复用plan_001。每个level做Taylor expansion accuracy test。\n650\t\n651\t    '\n652\t  expected_results:\n653\t    sparsity_levels:\n654\t    - 0.3\n655\t    - 0.35\n656\t    - 0.4\n657\t    - 0.45\n658\t    - 0.5\n659\t    - 0.55\n660\t    - 0.6\n661\t    kl_ppls:\n662\t    - 7.05\n663\t    - 7.42\n664\t    - 7.98\n665\t    - 8.51\n666\t    - 9.2\n667\t    - 10.82\n668\t    - 13.15\n669\t    bce_ppls:\n670\t    - 14.55\n671\t    - 17.82\n672\t    - 19.98\n673\t    - 24.71\n674\t    - 28.2\n675\t    - 33.62\n676\t    - 42.65\n677\t    kl_bce_deltas:\n678\t    - 7.5\n679\t    - 10.4\n680\t    - 12.0\n681\t    - 16.2\n682\t    - 19.0\n683\t    - 22.8\n684\t    - 29.5\n685\t    s2_fit_coefficient_a: 79.2\n686\t    s2_fit_r_squared: 0.97\n687\t    s2_plus_linear_fit_r_squared: 0.99\n688\t    taylor_accuracy_pct:\n689\t    - 96.8\n690\t    - 95.4\n691\t    - 94.1\n692\t    - 92.5\n693\t    - 89.8\n694\t    - 85.6\n695\t    - 80.2\n696\t    predicted_deltas_s2_only:\n697\t    - 7.13\n698\t    - 9.7\n699\t    - 12.67\n700\t    - 16.03\n701\t    - 19.8\n702\t    - 23.96\n703\t    - 28.51\n704\t  result_rationale: 'KL的梯度dL_KL/ds_j通过Jacobian d_logits/dh耦合所有active neurons。当sparsity为s时，\n705\t    每个pruned neuron的interaction涉及O(sD)个其他pruned neurons，total interaction scale为 O(s²D²)。BCE的factorized\n706\t    gradient完全忽略这些interactions。因此KL-BCE quality delta 应当scale as s²（leading term来自pairwise\n707\t    neuron interaction）。 实验数据R²=0.97证实quadratic scaling dominates。Taylor expansion在低sparsity（30-40%）\n708\t    下accuracy > 94%是因为higher-order terms（s³等）negligible；在高sparsity（55-60%） accuracy降到80-86%是因为三体及更高阶interaction开始significant——这本身也是consistent\n709\t    with the theory（Taylor展开在远离展开点时精度下降）。 加入linear term后R²=0.99，说明residual主要是one lower-order\n710\t    correction。 Claim 3（quadratic scaling）定量验证通过。\n711\t\n712\t    '\n713\t  tables:\n714\t  - name: 'Table 9: Sparsity Sweep Results'\n715\t    columns:\n716\t    - Sparsity s\n717\t    - s²\n718\t    - KL PPL\n719\t    - BCE PPL\n720\t    - Δ (BCE−KL)\n721\t    - Predicted Δ (as²)\n722\t    - Taylor Acc %\n723\t    rows:\n724\t    - - 0.3\n725\t      - 0.09\n726\t      - 7.05\n727\t      - 14.55\n728\t      - 7.5\n729\t      - 7.13\n730\t      - 96.8\n731\t    - - 0.35\n732\t      - 0.123\n733\t      - 7.42\n734\t      - 17.82\n735\t      - 10.4\n736\t      - 9.7\n737\t      - 95.4\n738\t    - - 0.4\n739\t      - 0.16\n740\t      - 7.98\n741\t      - 19.98\n742\t      - 12.0\n743\t      - 12.67\n744\t      - 94.1\n745\t    - - 0.45\n746\t      - 0.203\n747\t      - 8.51\n748\t      - 24.71\n749\t      - 16.2\n750\t      - 16.03\n751\t      - 92.5\n752\t    - - 0.5\n753\t      - 0.25\n754\t      - 9.2\n755\t      - 28.2\n756\t      - 19.0\n757\t      - 19.8\n758\t      - 89.8\n759\t    - - 0.55\n760\t      - 0.303\n761\t      - 10.82\n762\t      - 33.62\n763\t      - 22.8\n764\t      - 23.96\n765\t      - 85.6\n766\t    - - 0.6\n767\t      - 0.36\n768\t      - 13.15\n769\t      - 42.65\n770\t      - 29.5\n771\t      - 28.51\n772\t      - 80.2\n773\t  - name: 'Table 9b: Scaling Fit Statistics'\n774\t    columns:\n775\t    - Model\n776\t    - R²\n777\t    - Parameters\n778\t    rows:\n779\t    - - Δ = as²\n780\t      - 0.97\n781\t      - a=79.2\n782\t    - - Δ = as² + bs\n783\t      - 0.99\n784\t      - a=68.1, b=5.8\n785\t    - - Δ = as² + bs + c\n786\t      - 0.99\n787\t      - a=65.3, b=7.2, c=−0.4\n788\t  figures_description:\n789\t  - 'Scatter + fitted curve: x=s², y=KL-BCE delta, 实测点+quadratic fit曲线+95% CI band。R²=0.97标注'\n790\t  - 'Dual-axis line plot: x=sparsity, 左轴=KL PPL和BCE PPL（两条线），右轴=delta（bar chart），展示gap加速增长'\n791\t  - 'Taylor accuracy vs sparsity: 展示理论预测precision随sparsity的graceful degradation'\n792\t  analysis: 'KL-BCE delta与s²的R²=0.97，定量验证了gradient coupling theory的核心预测。 Quadratic\n793\t    scaling意味着在高sparsity regime（>50%），KL的优势accelerates—— 这提供了一个可检验的、非trivial的理论预测，不仅描述已有数据，也predicts\n794\t    extrapolation behavior。Taylor accuracy的graceful degradation pattern进一步 增强理论credibility。Claim\n795\t    3直接成立。\n796\t\n797\t    '\n798\t- name: Mistral-7B-v0.3 Cross-Architecture Validation\n799\t  plan_id: plan_009\n800\t  description: '在Mistral-7B-v0.3（GQA + sliding window attention，不同于Llama的GQA-only）上\n801\t    复现KL-only vs BCE+comp comparison。Core benchmarks: WikiText-2 PPL, ARC-c, MMLU。3\n802\t    seeds each。\n803\t\n804\t    '\n805\t  expected_results:\n806\t    mistral_dense_wikitext2_ppl: 5.48\n807\t    mistral_dense_arc_c: 58.1\n808\t    mistral_dense_mmlu: 62.8\n809\t    mistral_kl_s42_ppl: 8.12\n810\t    mistral_kl_s123_ppl: 8.35\n811\t    mistral_kl_s456_ppl: 8.18\n812\t    mistral_kl_mean_ppl: 8.22\n813\t    mistral_kl_std_ppl: 0.1\n814\t    mistral_kl_model_sparsity: 0.498\n815\t    mistral_kl_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct: 50.0\n816\t    mistral_kl_arc_c: 56.4\n817\t    mistral_kl_mmlu: 61.3\n818\t    mistral_bce_comp_s42_ppl: 12.81\n819\t    mistral_bce_comp_s123_ppl: 13.24\n820\t    mistral_bce_comp_s456_ppl: 12.53\n821\t    mistral_bce_comp_mean_ppl: 12.86\n822\t    mistral_bce_comp_std_ppl: 0.29\n823\t    mistral_bce_comp_model_sparsity: 0.497\n824\t    mistral_bce_comp_arc_c: 50.8\n825\t    mistral_bce_comp_mmlu: 55.9\n826\t    mistral_kl_vs_bce_comp_ppl_gap: 4.64\n827\t    mistral_kl_vs_bce_comp_ppl_gap_pct: 36.1\n828\t  result_rationale: 'Mistral-7B-v0.3使用GQA + sliding window attention，SwiGLU FFN结构与Llama相同但\n829\t    attention pattern不同，导致不同的activation sparsity distribution。KL的gradient coupling\n830\t    property是loss function的数学性质，与architecture无关——只要model有SwiGLU FFN且sparsity 在hidden\n831\t    states上操作，KL就能捕获joint interactions。因此KL优势在Mistral上同方向复现。 PPL increase 50%（vs Llama的50.3%）高度一致。Gap绝对值（4.64\n832\t    vs 9.44）较小是因为 Mistral的dense PPL更低（5.48 vs 6.12），两个model的relative gap pattern一致。\n833\t    Sliding window attention可能使某些layers的neuron importance更localized，略微 降低BCE+comp的absolute\n834\t    PPL（12.86 vs Llama的18.64），但不改变KL dominance。\n835\t\n836\t    '\n837\t  tables:\n838\t  - name: 'Table 10: Mistral-7B-v0.3 Cross-Architecture Validation'\n839\t    columns:\n840\t    - Condition\n841\t    - Wiki PPL↓\n842\t    - ARC-c↑\n843\t    - MMLU↑\n844\t    rows:\n845\t    - - Dense\n846\t      - 5.48\n847\t      - 58.1\n848\t      - 62.8\n849\t    - - KL-only\n850\t      - 8.22±0.10\n851\t      - 56.4\n852\t      - 61.3\n853\t    - - BCE+comp\n854\t      - 12.86±0.29\n855\t      - 50.8\n856\t      - 55.9\n857\t    - - Gap (KL vs BCE+comp)\n858\t      - −4.64\n859\t      - '+5.6'\n860\t      - '+5.4'\n861\t  - name: 'Table 10b: Cross-Architecture Consistency'\n862\t    columns:\n863\t    - Metric\n864\t    - Llama 3.1 8B\n865\t    - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n866\t    rows:\n867\t    - - KL PPL increase vs dense\n868\t      - 50.3%\n869\t      - 50.0%\n870\t    - - KL vs BCE+comp gap (PPL)\n871\t      - 9.44\n872\t      - 4.64\n873\t    - - KL vs BCE+comp gap (%)\n874\t      - 50.6%\n875\t      - 36.1%\n876\t  figures_description:\n877\t  - 'Side-by-side bar chart: Llama和Mistral的KL-only vs BCE+comp PPL，展示cross-architecture\n878\t    consistency'\n879\t  analysis: 'Mistral-7B-v0.3成功复现KL dominance：KL-only (8.22) vs BCE+comp (12.86)，gap\n880\t    36%。 KL PPL increase vs dense（50%）与Llama（50.3%）惊人一致，证明KL的优势是loss function 的universal\n881\t    property而非architecture-specific artifact。排除reviewer concern \"Single model / limited\n882\t    generalization\"。\n883\t\n884\t    '\n885\t- name: LongBench Long-Context Evaluation\n886\t  plan_id: plan_010\n887\t  description: 'LongBench English subset（4K-32K tokens），所有conditions。 Per-task-type\n888\t    breakdown: single-doc QA, multi-doc QA, summarization, few-shot, code。\n889\t\n890\t    '\n891\t  expected_results:\n892\t    dense_longbench_avg: 43.5\n893\t    teal_longbench_avg: 35.4\n894\t    wina_longbench_avg: 33.8\n895\t    rsparse_longbench_avg: 34.6\n896\t    spon_longbench_avg: 39.8\n897\t    bce_comp_longbench_avg: 32.1\n898\t    kl_only_longbench_avg: 42.1\n899\t    spon_kl_longbench_avg: 42.8\n900\t    kl_single_doc_qa: 44.8\n901\t    kl_multi_doc_qa: 38.2\n902\t    kl_summarization: 42.5\n903\t    kl_few_shot: 47.1\n904\t    kl_code: 38.0\n905\t    bce_comp_single_doc_qa: 35.2\n906\t    bce_comp_multi_doc_qa: 28.4\n907\t    bce_comp_summarization: 33.8\n908\t    bce_comp_few_shot: 34.6\n909\t    bce_comp_code: 28.5\n910\t    dense_single_doc_qa: 46.2\n911\t    dense_multi_doc_qa: 39.5\n912\t    dense_summarization: 43.8\n913\t    dense_few_shot: 48.3\n914\t    dense_code: 39.6\n915\t    kl_only_avg_drop_vs_dense: 1.4\n916\t    bce_comp_avg_drop_vs_dense: 11.4\n917\t    kl_worst_task_type: multi-doc QA\n918\t    kl_worst_task_drop: 3.3\n919\t  result_rationale: '长序列evaluation测试predictor是否generalize beyond短训练序列。KL的output-distribution\n920\t    matching objective在长序列下仍然有效，因为它不依赖specific sequence length——predictor 看到的是per-token\n921\t    hidden states，length主要影响attention pattern。KL-only的drop（1.4 avg） 与short-context\n922\t    evaluation一致。Multi-doc QA是最challenging的任务类型（需要cross-document reasoning），因此KL-only在此处drop最大（3.3\n923\t    points）。BCE+comp在长序列下degradation 更严重（11.4 avg drop）——因为BCE的per-neuron error在长序列中accumulates\n924\t    without compensation fully correcting the compounding effect。SPON+KL以42.8接近dense的43.5，\n925\t    进一步确认composition在长序列下仍然有效。\n926\t\n927\t    '\n928\t  tables:\n929\t  - name: 'Table 11: LongBench Per-Task-Type Breakdown'\n930\t    columns:\n931\t    - Task Type\n932\t    - Dense\n933\t    - TEAL\n934\t    - SPON\n935\t    - BCE+comp\n936\t    - KL-only\n937\t    - SPON+KL\n938\t    rows:\n939\t    - - Single-doc QA\n940\t      - 46.2\n941\t      - 38.1\n942\t      - 42.0\n943\t      - 35.2\n944\t      - 44.8\n945\t      - 45.3\n946\t    - - Multi-doc QA\n947\t      - 39.5\n948\t      - 31.2\n949\t      - 36.1\n950\t      - 28.4\n951\t      - 38.2\n952\t      - 38.8\n953\t    - - Summarization\n954\t      - 43.8\n955\t      - 35.8\n956\t      - 40.2\n957\t      - 33.8\n958\t      - 42.5\n959\t      - 43.1\n960\t    - - Few-shot\n961\t      - 48.3\n962\t      - 39.5\n963\t      - 44.3\n964\t      - 34.6\n965\t      - 47.1\n966\t      - 47.8\n967\t    - - Code\n968\t      - 39.6\n969\t      - 32.4\n970\t      - 36.5\n971\t      - 28.5\n972\t      - 38.0\n973\t      - 38.9\n974\t    - - '**Average**'\n975\t      - '**43.5**'\n976\t      - '**35.4**'\n977\t      - '**39.8**'\n978\t      - '**32.1**'\n979\t      - '**42.1**'\n980\t      - '**42.8**'\n981\t  figures_description:\n982\t  - 'Radar chart: 5个task types，Dense/KL-only/BCE+comp/SPON+KL四条线，展示KL-only profile近似dense'\n983\t  - 'Heatmap: methods × task types，color by score，直观展示BCE+comp在所有task types上consistently差'\n984\t  analysis: 'LongBench结果证明KL predictor在长序列（4K-32K）下generalization良好（avg drop 1.4），\n985\t    无需长序列finetune。BCE+comp在long-context下进一步恶化（avg drop 11.4 vs short-context的12.8%），\n986\t    可能因为compensation网络对error accumulation的correction在长序列下saturate。 增强了EMNLP venue\n987\t    fit（NLP-specific long-context evaluation）。\n988\t\n989\t    '\n990\t- name: MT-Bench Multi-Turn Instruction Following\n991\t  plan_id: plan_011\n992\t  description: 'MT-Bench 80题 × 8 categories，GPT-4o judge。测试sparsity对instruction following\n993\t    quality的影响。\n994\t\n995\t    '\n996\t  expected_results:\n997\t    dense_mtbench_avg: 7.21\n998\t    teal_mtbench_avg: 6.18\n999\t    spon_mtbench_avg: 6.78\n1000\t    bce_comp_mtbench_avg: 6.42\n1001\t    kl_only_mtbench_avg: 7.05\n1002\t    spon_kl_mtbench_avg: 7.12\n1003\t    kl_writing: 7.35\n1004\t    kl_roleplay: 7.15\n1005\t    kl_reasoning: 6.65\n1006\t    kl_math: 6.55\n1007\t    kl_coding: 6.85\n1008\t    kl_extraction: 7.45\n1009\t    kl_stem: 7.1\n1010\t    kl_humanities: 7.3\n1011\t    bce_comp_writing: 6.8\n1012\t    bce_comp_reasoning: 5.85\n1013\t    bce_comp_math: 5.65\n1014\t    bce_comp_coding: 5.9\n1015\t  result_rationale: 'MT-Bench测试multi-turn instruction following——一个对output quality高度敏感的setting。\n1016\t    KL-only（7.05）与dense（7.21）差距仅0.16（GPT-4o judge的scoring granularity内）， 说明KL的output\n1017\t    distribution matching直接保留了instruction following能力。 Math和reasoning categories drop略大（KL-only\n1018\t    6.55/6.65 vs dense ~6.8/6.85），因为 这些tasks需要precise multi-step reasoning，对任何distribution\n1019\t    shift更敏感。 BCE+comp（6.42）在reasoning-heavy categories下degradation严重（5.85/5.65），因为\n1020\t    BCE的imprecise sparsity mask在需要所有neurons correctly participate的reasoning chain上\n1021\t    产生compounding errors，compensation无法fully recover。\n1022\t\n1023\t    '\n1024\t  tables:\n1025\t  - name: 'Table 12: MT-Bench Results'\n1026\t    columns:\n1027\t    - Method\n1028\t    - Avg Score\n1029\t    - Writing\n1030\t    - Reasoning\n1031\t    - Math\n1032\t    - Coding\n1033\t    rows:\n1034\t    - - Dense\n1035\t      - 7.21\n1036\t      - 7.5\n1037\t      - 6.85\n1038\t      - 6.8\n1039\t      - 7.1\n1040\t    - - TEAL\n1041\t      - 6.18\n1042\t      - 6.45\n1043\t      - 5.6\n1044\t      - 5.4\n1045\t      - 5.8\n1046\t    - - SPON\n1047\t      - 6.78\n1048\t      - 7.1\n1049\t      - 6.35\n1050\t      - 6.15\n1051\t      - 6.55\n1052\t    - - BCE+comp\n1053\t      - 6.42\n1054\t      - 6.8\n1055\t      - 5.85\n1056\t      - 5.65\n1057\t      - 5.9\n1058\t    - - KL-only\n1059\t      - 7.05\n1060\t      - 7.35\n1061\t      - 6.65\n1062\t      - 6.55\n1063\t      - 6.85\n1064\t    - - SPON+KL\n1065\t      - 7.12\n1066\t      - 7.4\n1067\t      - 6.75\n1068\t      - 6.65\n1069\t      - 6.95\n1070\t  figures_description:\n1071\t  - 'Grouped bar chart per category: Dense vs KL-only vs BCE+comp，8个categories并排'\n1072\t  analysis: 'MT-Bench进一步确认KL-only在generation quality上接近dense。GPT-4o judge评分差异 KL-only\n1073\t    vs dense仅0.16——在judge的noise floor以内。BCE+comp在math/reasoning上 severe degradation（-1.15/-1.00\n1074\t    vs dense），而KL-only仅-0.25/-0.20。 Strengthens EMNLP NLP evaluation story。\n1075\t\n1076\t    '\n1077\t- name: RULER Synthetic Long-Context Diagnostics\n1078\t  plan_id: plan_012\n1079\t  description: 'RULER synthetic evaluation at 4K and 16K context，3 representative\n1080\t    task types (needle-in-a-haystack, multi-key retrieval, variable tracking)。 Fine-grained\n1081\t    diagnostics complementing LongBench。\n1082\t\n1083\t    '\n1084\t  expected_results:\n1085\t    dense_ruler_4k_avg: 95.2\n1086\t    kl_only_ruler_4k_avg: 93.8\n1087\t    bce_comp_ruler_4k_avg: 87.4\n1088\t    spon_kl_ruler_4k_avg: 94.5\n1089\t    dense_ruler_16k_avg: 88.5\n1090\t    kl_only_ruler_16k_avg: 86.1\n1091\t    bce_comp_ruler_16k_avg: 78.3\n1092\t    spon_kl_ruler_16k_avg: 87.2\n1093\t    kl_needle_4k: 98.0\n1094\t    kl_needle_16k: 94.5\n1095\t    kl_multikey_4k: 91.2\n1096\t    kl_multikey_16k: 82.4\n1097\t    kl_vartrack_4k: 92.1\n1098\t    kl_vartrack_16k: 81.3\n1099\t    bce_comp_needle_4k: 94.5\n1100\t    bce_comp_needle_16k: 86.2\n1101\t    bce_comp_multikey_4k: 83.8\n1102\t    bce_comp_multikey_16k: 72.1\n1103\t    bce_comp_vartrack_4k: 83.9\n1104\t    bce_comp_vartrack_16k: 76.5\n1105\t    kl_only_4k_to_16k_drop: 7.7\n1106\t    bce_comp_4k_to_16k_drop: 9.1\n1107\t    dense_4k_to_16k_drop: 6.7\n1108\t  result_rationale: 'RULER的synthetic tasks提供controlled diagnostics——每个task isolate一种capability\n1109\t    (retrieval precision, multi-hop tracking等)。KL-only在4K下接近dense（93.8 vs 95.2）， 在16K下gracefully\n1110\t    degrade（86.1 vs 88.5）——4K→16K drop (7.7)接近dense pattern (6.7)， 说明KL predictor不会随context\n1111\t    length引入额外的degradation。BCE+comp的4K→16K drop更大 (9.1)，在multi-key retrieval（需要同时attend\n1112\t    to多个scattered positions）和variable tracking（需要maintain state across distance）上degradation尤其严重——因为这些tasks\n1113\t    对sparse mask quality最敏感，BCE的imprecise masks在长距离dependency上compounding。 Needle-in-a-haystack是最简单的task（单点retrieval），所有methods都表现好。\n1114\t\n1115\t    '\n1116\t  tables:\n1117\t  - name: 'Table 13: RULER Synthetic Evaluation'\n1118\t    columns:\n1119\t    - Task\n1120\t    - Context\n1121\t    - Dense\n1122\t    - KL-only\n1123\t    - BCE+comp\n1124\t    - SPON+KL\n1125\t    rows:\n1126\t    - - Needle\n1127\t      - 4K\n1128\t      - 99.2\n1129\t      - 98.0\n1130\t      - 94.5\n1131\t      - 98.5\n1132\t    - - Needle\n1133\t      - 16K\n1134\t      - 96.8\n1135\t      - 94.5\n1136\t      - 86.2\n1137\t      - 95.8\n1138\t    - - Multi-key\n1139\t      - 4K\n1140\t      - 93.5\n1141\t      - 91.2\n1142\t      - 83.8\n1143\t      - 92.4\n1144\t    - - Multi-key\n1145\t      - 16K\n1146\t      - 84.1\n1147\t      - 82.4\n1148\t      - 72.1\n1149\t      - 83.5\n1150\t    - - Var-track\n1151\t      - 4K\n1152\t      - 92.8\n1153\t      - 92.1\n1154\t      - 83.9\n1155\t      - 92.5\n1156\t    - - Var-track\n1157\t      - 16K\n1158\t      - 84.5\n1159\t      - 81.3\n1160\t      - 76.5\n1161\t      - 83.2\n1162\t    - - '**Average**'\n1163\t      - '**4K**'\n1164\t      - '**95.2**'\n1165\t      - '**93.8**'\n1166\t      - '**87.4**'\n1167\t      - '**94.5**'\n1168\t    - - '**Average**'\n1169\t      - '**16K**'\n1170\t      - '**88.5**'\n1171\t      - '**86.1**'\n1172\t      - '**78.3**'\n1173\t      - '**87.2**'\n1174\t  figures_description:\n1175\t  - 'Line plot: x=context length (4K, 16K), y=RULER avg accuracy, 每个method一条线，展示degradation\n1176\t    rate'\n1177\t  - 'Heatmap: task × method × context length，诊断哪些capabilities被sparsity影响最大'\n1178\t  analysis: RULER诊断补充LongBench：KL-only的context-length degradation pattern与dense一致\n1179\t    (4K→16K drop差仅1 point)，而BCE+comp多drop 2.4 points。Multi-key retrieval 是differentiation最大的task（KL\n1180\t    82.4 vs BCE+comp 72.1 at 16K），这与理论一致—— multi-key需要FFN准确处理多个simultaneously relevant\n1181\t    positions，joint neuron interaction quality直接影响结果。\n1182\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"be4af677-c918-498a-8593-19b0dadd846b","uuid":"fc380477-bee8-4f8f-9a8a-2ec3aff8dede","timestamp":"2026-05-15T17:38:47.863Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_14/projects/distill_sparse_swiglu/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T164925/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'KL categorically dominates. Headline: ''Output-distribution distillation\n  makes compensation networks obsolete for SwiGLU sparsity.'' 三线汇聚——理论（gradient coupling解释joint\n  interaction）、 实验（KL-only vs BCE+comp gap 9+ PPL points）、实践（省256MB compensation weights\n  + per-layer GEMV）。 所有planned实验均确认三条claims原样成立，无需调整framing。投EMNLP Efficient Methods。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Four-Condition Ablation @ 50% Sparsity\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: 'KL-only扩展到5 seeds（新增s0, s1），BCE+comp 5 seeds，KL+comp 3 seeds。 已有数据：KL-only\n    3 seeds (s42/s123/s456)均~9.2 PPL；BCE-only 3 seeds均~28.2 PPL。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    kl_only_s42_ppl: 9.2142\n    kl_only_s123_ppl: 9.2474\n    kl_only_s456_ppl: 9.14\n    kl_only_s0_ppl: 9.19\n    kl_only_s1_ppl: 9.23\n    kl_only_mean_ppl: 9.2\n    kl_only_std_ppl: 0.04\n    kl_only_model_sparsity: 0.498\n    bce_comp_s42_ppl: 18.22\n    bce_comp_s123_ppl: 18.91\n    bce_comp_s456_ppl: 18.38\n    bce_comp_s0_ppl: 18.65\n    bce_comp_s1_ppl: 19.05\n    bce_comp_mean_ppl: 18.64\n    bce_comp_std_ppl: 0.33\n    bce_comp_model_sparsity: 0.496\n    kl_comp_s42_ppl: 9.05\n    kl_comp_s123_ppl: 9.08\n    kl_comp_s456_ppl: 8.92\n    kl_comp_mean_ppl: 9.02\n    kl_comp_std_ppl: 0.07\n    bce_only_mean_ppl: 28.16\n    bce_only_std_ppl: 0.17\n    kl_only_vs_bce_comp_gap: 9.44\n    kl_only_vs_dense_increase_pct: 50.3\n    bce_comp_vs_dense_increase_pct: 204.6\n    comp_benefit_for_bce_ppl: 9.52\n    comp_benefit_for_kl_ppl: 0.18\n  result_rationale: 'KL的gradient dL_KL/ds_j通过d_logits/dh * dh/dm耦合所有active neurons，天然捕获joint\n    interaction effects。因此KL-only已将output distribution对齐到接近dense水平（PPL 9.2 vs 6.12），\n    compensation网络能额外修正的residual极小（仅0.18 PPL），大部分interaction已被KL loss消化。 反观BCE的per-neuron\n    factorized gradient只优化每个neuron独立的on/off decision，完全忽略joint effects——这在50% sparsity下产生巨大误差（PPL\n    28.2）。Compensation网络虽然能回收~40%的 质量gap（28.2→18.6），但其capacity有限，无法弥补BCE从根源上丢失的coupling\n    information。 5-seed KL-only的极低std（0.04）证明s456不是outlier，训练高度稳定。 核心结论：compensation对KL是冗余的（0.18\n    PPL改善 vs 9.44 PPL gap），claims 1成立。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Four-Condition Ablation Results (WikiText-2 PPL, Llama 3.1 8B,\n      50% sparsity)'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Seeds\n    - PPL (mean±std)\n    - Δ vs Dense\n    - Comp Benefit\n    rows:\n    - - Dense\n      - '-'\n      - '6.12'\n      - '-'\n      - '-'\n    - - BCE-only\n      - 3\n      - 28.16±0.17\n      - +360%\n      - '-'\n    - - BCE+comp\n      - 5\n      - 18.64±0.33\n      - +205%\n      - −9.52\n    - - KL-only\n      - 5\n      - 9.20±0.04\n      - +50%\n      - '-'\n    - - KL+comp\n      - 3\n      - 9.02±0.07\n      - +47%\n      - −0.18\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Box plot: 5-seed PPL distributions for KL-only vs BCE+comp，中位线、IQR和outliers，直观展示两个分布零重叠'\n  - 'Bar chart: compensation benefit (PPL reduction) for BCE vs KL，量化compensation对两种loss的边际价值'\n  analysis: 'KL-only以9.20 PPL大幅碾压BCE+comp的18.64 PPL（gap 9.44 points），且compensation对KL仅贡献\n    0.18 PPL改善（vs对BCE贡献9.52），证明compensation网络对KL训练的predictor完全不必要。 5-seed std=0.04证明高度可复现。Headline\n    claim直接成立：output-distribution distillation eliminates the need for compensation\n    networks.\n\n    '\n- name: STE Baseline — Isolating Loss vs Relaxation\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '用Straight-Through Estimator替换Gumbel-sigmoid，保持KL loss不变。3 seeds。 目的：确认KL优势来自loss\n    function而非Gumbel relaxation。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    ste_kl_s42_ppl: 9.72\n    ste_kl_s123_ppl: 9.85\n    ste_kl_s456_ppl: 9.64\n    ste_kl_mean_ppl: 9.74\n    ste_kl_std_ppl: 0.09\n    ste_kl_model_sparsity: 0.497\n    ste_kl_vs_gumbel_kl_gap: 0.54\n    ste_kl_vs_bce_only_gap: 18.42\n    gumbel_contribution_pct: 2.8\n  result_rationale: 'STE用biased but unbiased-in-expectation的梯度直通传播，丢失了Gumbel relaxation提供的\n    smooth gradient landscape。因此STE+KL比Gumbel+KL略差（+0.54 PPL），对应predictor在 decision\n    boundary附近的optimization稍差。但关键是STE+KL（9.74）仍远优于Gumbel+BCE（28.16）， 说明KL-BCE的18.96\n    point gap中97%以上来自loss function的gradient coupling property， Gumbel relaxation仅贡献~3%的marginal\n    improvement。这直接排除了reviewer concern \"Gumbel-sigmoid relaxation, not KL, explains\n    gains\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 2: Relaxation Method Ablation'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Relaxation\n    - Loss\n    - PPL (mean±std)\n    rows:\n    - - Gumbel+KL (ours)\n      - Gumbel-sigmoid\n      - KL\n      - 9.20±0.04\n    - - STE+KL\n      - Straight-Through\n      - KL\n      - 9.74±0.09\n    - - Gumbel+BCE\n      - Gumbel-sigmoid\n      - BCE\n      - 28.16±0.17\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Attribution bar chart: 将KL-BCE总gap分解为loss contribution (97.2%) vs relaxation\n    contribution (2.8%)'\n  analysis: 'STE实验明确归因：KL的gradient coupling是优势的几乎全部来源（97%），Gumbel relaxation是 锦上添花的minor\n    optimization trick。这为理论narrative提供clean experimental support， 且预防了reviewer的alternative\n    explanation attack。\n\n    '\n- name: Iso-Compute BCE vs KL\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: 'KL每步需full forward pass计算logit targets（~3.2x BCE per-step FLOPs）。 给BCE同等total\n    FLOPs预算（3.2x steps），排除compute advantage。3 seeds。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    kl_steps: 1000\n    kl_flops_per_step_ratio: 3.2\n    kl_total_flops_ratio: 3200\n    bce_standard_steps: 1000\n    bce_extended_steps: 3200\n    bce_extended_total_flops_ratio: 3200\n    bce_extended_s42_ppl: 25.28\n    bce_extended_s123_ppl: 25.83\n    bce_extended_s456_ppl: 25.12\n    bce_extended_mean_ppl: 25.41\n    bce_extended_std_ppl: 0.31\n    bce_standard_mean_ppl: 28.16\n    improvement_from_extended_training: 2.75\n    remaining_gap_vs_kl: 16.21\n    training_wall_clock_kl_hours: 4.2\n    training_wall_clock_bce_extended_hours: 4.1\n  result_rationale: 'BCE的梯度dL_BCE/ds_j = (σ(s_j) - t_j) * σ''(s_j)仅依赖neuron j自身的target，\n    更多training steps只能更精确地拟合这个per-neuron target——但target本身就是次优的 （忽略joint interaction）。因此extended\n    training让BCE-only从28.16降到25.41（降2.75）， 收益递减明显（loss curve在~2000步后plateau），而与KL的gap仍有16.21\n    points。 这证明KL的优势是information-theoretic的（loss function的gradient structure差异）， 不是compute-driven的，直接回应reviewer\n    concern \"KL wins only because more compute\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: Iso-Compute Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Steps\n    - Total FLOPs (relative)\n    - PPL (mean±std)\n    rows:\n    - - KL (Gumbel)\n      - 1000\n      - 3200x\n      - 9.20±0.04\n    - - BCE (standard)\n      - 1000\n      - 1000x\n      - 28.16±0.17\n    - - BCE (extended)\n      - 3200\n      - 3200x\n      - 25.41±0.31\n  figures_description:\n  - 'BCE training curve (PPL vs steps): 展示extended training的diminishing returns，标注KL水平线作为reference'\n  - 'FLOPs-PPL scatter: 三个condition在iso-FLOPs平面上的位置'\n  analysis: '即使给BCE 3.2x的training budget，PPL只从28.16降到25.41，distance to KL-only（16.21）\n    几乎未缩小。BCE的information bottleneck在loss function级别，无法通过更多compute突破。\n\n    '\n- name: SPON Reimplementation & Validation\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: '在Llama 3.1 8B上重新实现SPON（learnable per-layer bias vectors + KL training），\n    在5个QA benchmarks上验证质量以确认实现正确性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    spon_wikitext2_ppl: 10.82\n    spon_model_sparsity: 0.501\n    spon_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct: 76.9\n    spon_arc_c: 51.2\n    spon_arc_e: 74.5\n    spon_boolq: 79.3\n    spon_piqa: 78.1\n    spon_winogrande: 74.8\n    spon_params_bytes: 1048576\n    spon_training_time_minutes: 12\n    dense_arc_c: 55.2\n    dense_arc_e: 79.4\n    dense_boolq: 83.1\n    dense_piqa: 81.3\n    dense_winogrande: 77.8\n  result_rationale: 'SPON使用input-independent的bias correction——本质上是per-layer calibration，矫正average-case\n    下sparsity引入的activation drift。由于是static的，它只能修正E[Δh]（期望偏移），无法处理 per-input variation\n    Var[Δh|x]。因此SPON将PPL从training-free水平（~12-13）压到10.82， 是一个meaningful but limited的improvement。QA\n    benchmarks上drops 3-6%符合PPL改善幅度。 SPON的主要价值不在于standalone quality，而是作为composition实验的building\n    block—— 它修正的orthogonal component（average drift）与contextual predictor修正的component（per-input\n    variation） 应当可加。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4: SPON Validation on QA Benchmarks'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - Dense\n    - SPON\n    - Δ (abs)\n    rows:\n    - - ARC-c\n      - 55.2\n      - 51.2\n      - −4.0\n    - - ARC-e\n      - 79.4\n      - 74.5\n      - −4.9\n    - - BoolQ\n      - 83.1\n      - 79.3\n      - −3.8\n    - - PIQA\n      - 81.3\n      - 78.1\n      - −3.2\n    - - WinoGrande\n      - 77.8\n      - 74.8\n      - −3.0\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Radar chart: Dense vs SPON在5个QA tasks上的profile，验证SPON实现没有catastrophic failure'\n  analysis: 'SPON实现通过QA benchmark验证，drops幅度与原论文一致（3-5 points），确认实现正确性。 PPL 10.82定位在training-free（12-13）和contextual-KL（9.2）之间，为claim\n    2 的additivity实验提供可靠的static correction baseline。\n\n    '\n- name: SPON + KL Predictor Composition\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: '同时应用SPON bias correction和KL contextual prediction。 测试output-space\n    linearity（interaction residual）和per-layer orthogonality。3 seeds。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    spon_kl_s42_ppl: 7.95\n    spon_kl_s123_ppl: 8.12\n    spon_kl_s456_ppl: 7.88\n    spon_kl_mean_ppl: 7.98\n    spon_kl_std_ppl: 0.1\n    spon_kl_model_sparsity: 0.499\n    spon_kl_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct: 30.4\n    spon_alone_ppl_recovery: 1.68\n    kl_alone_ppl_recovery: 3.3\n    combined_ppl_recovery: 4.52\n    predicted_additive_recovery: 4.98\n    interaction_residual_pct: 6.8\n    logit_interaction_residual_l2_norm: 0.042\n    logit_spon_correction_l2_norm: 0.38\n    logit_kl_correction_l2_norm: 0.61\n    logit_interaction_ratio_pct: 6.8\n    mean_cosine_similarity_spon_kl: 0.11\n    max_cosine_similarity_spon_kl: 0.23\n    layers_with_cosine_gt_0_2: 4\n  result_rationale: 'SPON修正c_s = E[Δh]（average activation drift），KL predictor修正c_θ(x)\n    = Δh(x) - E[Δh] （per-input residual variation）。两者在correction space中近似正交——SPON的correction是\n    constant vector，KL的correction是zero-mean（训练过程中自然去中心化）。因此组合 c = c_s + c_θ(x)的interaction\n    residual很小（6.8%）。PPL从KL-only的9.20进一步压到7.98， 接近dense的6.12。mean cosine similarity仅0.11，证明两种correction确实address不同的\n    error components。少数layers（4/32）cosine > 0.2，是因为某些layers的average drift 和per-input\n    variation方向部分对齐（如early layers的token-independent patterns）， 但这不影响整体additivity。Claim\n    2（modular decomposition）直接成立。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: Composition Additivity Analysis'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - PPL Recovery (from TEAL baseline)\n    - Predicted Additive\n    - Actual\n    - Interaction Residual\n    rows:\n    - - SPON only\n      - 1.68\n      - '-'\n      - '-'\n      - '-'\n    - - KL only\n      - 3.3\n      - '-'\n      - '-'\n      - '-'\n    - - SPON+KL\n      - '-'\n      - 4.98\n      - 4.52\n      - 9.2%\n  - name: 'Table 5b: Per-Layer Cosine Similarity Statistics'\n    columns:\n    - Statistic\n    - Value\n    rows:\n    - - Mean cosine\n      - 0.11\n    - - Median cosine\n      - 0.08\n    - - Max cosine\n      - 0.23\n    - - Layers > 0.2\n      - 4/32\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter plot: per-layer SPON correction magnitude vs KL correction magnitude，color\n    by cosine similarity，展示orthogonality'\n  - 'Logit-space decomposition visualization: ||Δ(s+c)||, ||Δ(s)||, ||Δ(c)||, ||residual||\n    的bar chart，直观展示linearity'\n  - 'PPL waterfall chart: Dense → TEAL → +SPON → +KL → SPON+KL，展示每个component的incremental\n    contribution'\n  analysis: 'SPON+KL组合将PPL压到7.98（仅比dense高30%），interaction residual 6.8% < 10%阈值， per-layer\n    cosine similarity平均0.11。c = c_s + c_θ(x)的modular decomposition experimentally\n    validated。两种correction address不同error sources的理论预测被定量确认。\n\n    '\n- name: Training-Free Baselines (TEAL, WINA, R-Sparse)\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: '三种training-free方法在Llama 3.1 8B @ 50% model-level sparsity下的质量。 建立三级hierarchy:\n    training-free < static-learned < contextual-learned。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    teal_wikitext2_ppl: 12.48\n    wina_wikitext2_ppl: 14.76\n    rsparse_wikitext2_ppl: 13.62\n    teal_model_sparsity: 0.5\n    wina_model_sparsity: 0.5\n    rsparse_model_sparsity: 0.5\n    teal_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct: 103.9\n    wina_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct: 141.3\n    rsparse_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct: 122.6\n  result_rationale: 'TEAL使用magnitude pruning + greedy per-layer allocation，在training-free中最优，因为\n    magnitude直接反映activation contribution。R-Sparse加入rank-aware scoring，理论上更好但 实现中的approximation引入noise，实际略逊于TEAL。WINA的weight-informed\n    scoring虽然 考虑了weight magnitude，但在SwiGLU的gated结构下，weight和activation importance的\n    correlation比standard FFN更弱（gate和up projection交互），因此表现最差。 所有三种方法PPL都在12-15范围，远逊于learned\n    methods（KL-only 9.2、SPON 10.8）， 建立clean的三级hierarchy。Training-free方法的根本限制是它们无法learn\n    per-input neuron importance patterns，只能依赖固定heuristic。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6: Training-Free Baseline Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Type\n    - WikiText-2 PPL\n    - Δ vs Dense\n    rows:\n    - - Dense\n      - '-'\n      - 6.12\n      - '-'\n    - - TEAL\n      - Magnitude + greedy\n      - 12.48\n      - +104%\n    - - R-Sparse\n      - Rank-aware\n      - 13.62\n      - +123%\n    - - WINA\n      - Weight-informed\n      - 14.76\n      - +141%\n    - - SPON\n      - Static learned (KL)\n      - 10.82\n      - +77%\n    - - KL-only\n      - Contextual learned (KL)\n      - 9.2\n      - +50%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Horizontal bar chart: 所有methods按PPL排序，color-coded by method type (training-free\n    / static / contextual)，清晰展示三级hierarchy'\n  analysis: '三级hierarchy清晰：training-free (12.5-14.8) < static-learned (10.8) < contextual-learned\n    (9.2)。 每级提升对应information quality的提高：heuristic → average-case calibration → per-input\n    optimization。 TEAL作为最强training-free baseline仍比KL-only差3.28 PPL points（+36%），justifies\n    learned approach的overhead。\n\n    '\n- name: Full Benchmark Suite + Latency Profiling\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '所有conditions在WikiText-2/C4 PPL、5个discriminative tasks、wall-clock profiling上的\n    完整evaluation。构建efficiency-accuracy Pareto frontier。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    dense_wikitext2_ppl: 6.12\n    teal_wikitext2_ppl: 12.48\n    wina_wikitext2_ppl: 14.76\n    rsparse_wikitext2_ppl: 13.62\n    spon_wikitext2_ppl: 10.82\n    bce_only_wikitext2_ppl: 28.16\n    bce_comp_wikitext2_ppl: 18.64\n    kl_only_wikitext2_ppl: 9.2\n    kl_comp_wikitext2_ppl: 9.02\n    spon_kl_wikitext2_ppl: 7.98\n    dense_c4_ppl: 7.85\n    teal_c4_ppl: 15.12\n    wina_c4_ppl: 17.88\n    rsparse_c4_ppl: 16.31\n    spon_c4_ppl: 13.24\n    bce_only_c4_ppl: 33.42\n    bce_comp_c4_ppl: 22.15\n    kl_only_c4_ppl: 11.38\n    kl_comp_c4_ppl: 11.12\n    spon_kl_c4_ppl: 9.81\n    dense_arc_c: 55.2\n    teal_arc_c: 48.1\n    wina_arc_c: 46.3\n    rsparse_arc_c: 47.2\n    spon_arc_c: 51.2\n    bce_comp_arc_c: 44.8\n    kl_only_arc_c: 54.3\n    spon_kl_arc_c: 54.8\n    dense_winogrande: 77.8\n    teal_winogrande: 72.4\n    wina_winogrande: 70.8\n    rsparse_winogrande: 71.5\n    spon_winogrande: 74.8\n    bce_comp_winogrande: 68.3\n    kl_only_winogrande: 76.9\n    spon_kl_winogrande: 77.2\n    dense_mmlu: 65.8\n    teal_mmlu: 58.2\n    wina_mmlu: 56.4\n    rsparse_mmlu: 57.1\n    spon_mmlu: 60.3\n    bce_comp_mmlu: 54.9\n    kl_only_mmlu: 65.0\n    spon_kl_mmlu: 65.4\n    dense_gsm8k: 53.8\n    teal_gsm8k: 44.2\n    wina_gsm8k: 41.8\n    rsparse_gsm8k: 43.1\n    spon_gsm8k: 46.5\n    bce_comp_gsm8k: 39.7\n    kl_only_gsm8k: 52.8\n    spon_kl_gsm8k: 53.2\n    dense_humaneval: 32.9\n    teal_humaneval: 26.2\n    wina_humaneval: 24.4\n    rsparse_humaneval: 25.6\n    spon_humaneval: 28.1\n    bce_comp_humaneval: 23.8\n    kl_only_humaneval: 32.3\n    spon_kl_humaneval: 32.5\n    kl_only_avg_acc_drop_pct: 1.3\n    spon_kl_avg_acc_drop_pct: 0.7\n    bce_comp_avg_acc_drop_pct: 12.8\n    dense_latency_ms: 16.8\n    teal_latency_ms: 11.2\n    spon_latency_ms: 10.9\n    bce_only_latency_ms: 12.0\n    bce_comp_latency_ms: 13.8\n    kl_only_latency_ms: 12.0\n    kl_comp_latency_ms: 13.8\n    spon_kl_latency_ms: 12.1\n    predictor_params_mb: 24\n    compensation_params_mb: 256\n    spon_params_mb: 1\n    kl_only_speedup_vs_dense_pct: 28.6\n    bce_comp_speedup_vs_dense_pct: 17.9\n    kl_only_speedup_vs_bce_comp_pct: 13.0\n  result_rationale: 'Downstream tasks与PPL高度correlated——KL-only的低PPL (9.20)直接转化为downstream任务上\n    接近dense的accuracy（平均drop仅1.3%）。这是因为KL优化output distribution matching， 保留了token-level的prediction\n    quality，而downstream tasks本质上都依赖model的next-token prediction能力。BCE+comp虽然有compensation，但其PPL\n    (18.64)反映的distribution mismatch 在需要precise reasoning的任务上（GSM8K, HumanEval）伤害更大（drop\n    26-28%），因为 这些任务对error compounding更敏感。 Wall-clock方面，KL-only和BCE-only的predictor开销相同（同架构），但KL-only不需要\n    compensation，因此比BCE+comp省1.8ms/token（13.8→12.0）。SPON+KL仅比KL-only多0.1ms （bias add几乎免费），但PPL进一步降到7.98。KL-only在Pareto\n    frontier上dominates BCE+comp——更快、更好、更小。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: Comprehensive Benchmark Results (Llama 3.1 8B, 50% sparsity)'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Wiki PPL↓\n    - C4 PPL↓\n    - ARC-c↑\n    - WinoG↑\n    - MMLU↑\n    - GSM8K↑\n    - HumanE↑\n    - Avg Δ↓\n    rows:\n    - - Dense\n      - 6.12\n      - 7.85\n      - 55.2\n      - 77.8\n      - 65.8\n      - 53.8\n      - 32.9\n      - —\n    - - TEAL\n      - 12.48\n      - 15.12\n      - 48.1\n      - 72.4\n      - 58.2\n      - 44.2\n      - 26.2\n      - −7.8\n    - - WINA\n      - 14.76\n      - 17.88\n      - 46.3\n      - 70.8\n      - 56.4\n      - 41.8\n      - 24.4\n      - −9.9\n    - - R-Sparse\n      - 13.62\n      - 16.31\n      - 47.2\n      - 71.5\n      - 57.1\n      - 43.1\n      - 25.6\n      - −8.8\n    - - SPON\n      - 10.82\n      - 13.24\n      - 51.2\n      - 74.8\n      - 60.3\n      - 46.5\n      - 28.1\n      - −5.3\n    - - BCE+comp\n      - 18.64\n      - 22.15\n      - 44.8\n      - 68.3\n      - 54.9\n      - 39.7\n      - 23.8\n      - −12.8\n    - - KL-only\n      - 9.2\n      - 11.38\n      - 54.3\n      - 76.9\n      - 65.0\n      - 52.8\n      - 32.3\n      - −1.3\n    - - SPON+KL\n      - 7.98\n      - 9.81\n      - 54.8\n      - 77.2\n      - 65.4\n      - 53.2\n      - 32.5\n      - −0.7\n  - name: 'Table 8: Inference Efficiency Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Latency (ms/tok)\n    - Speedup vs Dense\n    - Extra Params (MB)\n    - PPL\n    rows:\n    - - Dense\n      - 16.8\n      - 1.00×\n      - 0\n      - 6.12\n    - - TEAL\n      - 11.2\n      - 1.50×\n      - 0\n      - 12.48\n    - - SPON\n      - 10.9\n      - 1.54×\n      - 1\n      - 10.82\n    - - KL-only\n      - 12.0\n      - 1.40×\n      - 24\n      - 9.2\n    - - BCE+comp\n      - 13.8\n      - 1.22×\n      - 280\n      - 18.64\n    - - SPON+KL\n      - 12.1\n      - 1.39×\n      - 25\n      - 7.98\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Pareto frontier plot: x=latency (ms/tok), y=WikiText-2 PPL, 所有conditions标注。KL-only和SPON+KL在frontier上，BCE+comp\n    dominated'\n  - 'Grouped bar chart: 5个downstream tasks，每个task所有methods并排，直观展示KL-only接近dense而BCE+comp远逊'\n  - 'Taxonomy heatmap: 2D table (granularity × coupling) 填入PPL值，our cell (contextual\n    × KL) 最优'\n  analysis: 'KL-only在quality-efficiency Pareto frontier上strictly dominates BCE+comp：更低PPL（9.20\n    vs 18.64）， 更低latency（12.0 vs 13.8），更少参数（24MB vs 280MB）。Downstream tasks确认PPL gains\n    transfer：KL-only平均仅drop 1.3%（best tier阈值2%以内），BCE+comp drop 12.8%。 SPON+KL作为our\n    best configuration达到7.98 PPL和0.7%平均drop，接近free lunch。 Taxonomy table的每个cell都有实验数据支撑。\n\n    '\n- name: 7-Level Sparsity Sweep — Quadratic Scaling Test\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: '在30/35/40/45/50/55/60%七个sparsity level下训练KL-only和BCE-only（各1 seed），\n    测试KL-BCE delta ∝ s²的理论预测。50%复用plan_001。每个level做Taylor expansion accuracy test。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sparsity_levels:\n    - 0.3\n    - 0.35\n    - 0.4\n    - 0.45\n    - 0.5\n    - 0.55\n    - 0.6\n    kl_ppls:\n    - 7.05\n    - 7.42\n    - 7.98\n    - 8.51\n    - 9.2\n    - 10.82\n    - 13.15\n    bce_ppls:\n    - 14.55\n    - 17.82\n    - 19.98\n    - 24.71\n    - 28.2\n    - 33.62\n    - 42.65\n    kl_bce_deltas:\n    - 7.5\n    - 10.4\n    - 12.0\n    - 16.2\n    - 19.0\n    - 22.8\n    - 29.5\n    s2_fit_coefficient_a: 79.2\n    s2_fit_r_squared: 0.97\n    s2_plus_linear_fit_r_squared: 0.99\n    taylor_accuracy_pct:\n    - 96.8\n    - 95.4\n    - 94.1\n    - 92.5\n    - 89.8\n    - 85.6\n    - 80.2\n    predicted_deltas_s2_only:\n    - 7.13\n    - 9.7\n    - 12.67\n    - 16.03\n    - 19.8\n    - 23.96\n    - 28.51\n  result_rationale: 'KL的梯度dL_KL/ds_j通过Jacobian d_logits/dh耦合所有active neurons。当sparsity为s时，\n    每个pruned neuron的interaction涉及O(sD)个其他pruned neurons，total interaction scale为 O(s²D²)。BCE的factorized\n    gradient完全忽略这些interactions。因此KL-BCE quality delta 应当scale as s²（leading term来自pairwise\n    neuron interaction）。 实验数据R²=0.97证实quadratic scaling dominates。Taylor expansion在低sparsity（30-40%）\n    下accuracy > 94%是因为higher-order terms（s³等）negligible；在高sparsity（55-60%） accuracy降到80-86%是因为三体及更高阶interaction开始significant——这本身也是consistent\n    with the theory（Taylor展开在远离展开点时精度下降）。 加入linear term后R²=0.99，说明residual主要是one lower-order\n    correction。 Claim 3（quadratic scaling）定量验证通过。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 9: Sparsity Sweep Results'\n    columns:\n    - Sparsity s\n    - s²\n    - KL PPL\n    - BCE PPL\n    - Δ (BCE−KL)\n    - Predicted Δ (as²)\n    - Taylor Acc %\n    rows:\n    - - 0.3\n      - 0.09\n      - 7.05\n      - 14.55\n      - 7.5\n      - 7.13\n      - 96.8\n    - - 0.35\n      - 0.123\n      - 7.42\n      - 17.82\n      - 10.4\n      - 9.7\n      - 95.4\n    - - 0.4\n      - 0.16\n      - 7.98\n      - 19.98\n      - 12.0\n      - 12.67\n      - 94.1\n    - - 0.45\n      - 0.203\n      - 8.51\n      - 24.71\n      - 16.2\n      - 16.03\n      - 92.5\n    - - 0.5\n      - 0.25\n      - 9.2\n      - 28.2\n      - 19.0\n      - 19.8\n      - 89.8\n    - - 0.55\n      - 0.303\n      - 10.82\n      - 33.62\n      - 22.8\n      - 23.96\n      - 85.6\n    - - 0.6\n      - 0.36\n      - 13.15\n      - 42.65\n      - 29.5\n      - 28.51\n      - 80.2\n  - name: 'Table 9b: Scaling Fit Statistics'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - R²\n    - Parameters\n    rows:\n    - - Δ = as²\n      - 0.97\n      - a=79.2\n    - - Δ = as² + bs\n      - 0.99\n      - a=68.1, b=5.8\n    - - Δ = as² + bs + c\n      - 0.99\n      - a=65.3, b=7.2, c=−0.4\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter + fitted curve: x=s², y=KL-BCE delta, 实测点+quadratic fit曲线+95% CI band。R²=0.97标注'\n  - 'Dual-axis line plot: x=sparsity, 左轴=KL PPL和BCE PPL（两条线），右轴=delta（bar chart），展示gap加速增长'\n  - 'Taylor accuracy vs sparsity: 展示理论预测precision随sparsity的graceful degradation'\n  analysis: 'KL-BCE delta与s²的R²=0.97，定量验证了gradient coupling theory的核心预测。 Quadratic\n    scaling意味着在高sparsity regime（>50%），KL的优势accelerates—— 这提供了一个可检验的、非trivial的理论预测，不仅描述已有数据，也predicts\n    extrapolation behavior。Taylor accuracy的graceful degradation pattern进一步 增强理论credibility。Claim\n    3直接成立。\n\n    '\n- name: Mistral-7B-v0.3 Cross-Architecture Validation\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: '在Mistral-7B-v0.3（GQA + sliding window attention，不同于Llama的GQA-only）上\n    复现KL-only vs BCE+comp comparison。Core benchmarks: WikiText-2 PPL, ARC-c, MMLU。3\n    seeds each。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    mistral_dense_wikitext2_ppl: 5.48\n    mistral_dense_arc_c: 58.1\n    mistral_dense_mmlu: 62.8\n    mistral_kl_s42_ppl: 8.12\n    mistral_kl_s123_ppl: 8.35\n    mistral_kl_s456_ppl: 8.18\n    mistral_kl_mean_ppl: 8.22\n    mistral_kl_std_ppl: 0.1\n    mistral_kl_model_sparsity: 0.498\n    mistral_kl_ppl_increase_vs_dense_pct: 50.0\n    mistral_kl_arc_c: 56.4\n    mistral_kl_mmlu: 61.3\n    mistral_bce_comp_s42_ppl: 12.81\n    mistral_bce_comp_s123_ppl: 13.24\n    mistral_bce_comp_s456_ppl: 12.53\n    mistral_bce_comp_mean_ppl: 12.86\n    mistral_bce_comp_std_ppl: 0.29\n    mistral_bce_comp_model_sparsity: 0.497\n    mistral_bce_comp_arc_c: 50.8\n    mistral_bce_comp_mmlu: 55.9\n    mistral_kl_vs_bce_comp_ppl_gap: 4.64\n    mistral_kl_vs_bce_comp_ppl_gap_pct: 36.1\n  result_rationale: 'Mistral-7B-v0.3使用GQA + sliding window attention，SwiGLU FFN结构与Llama相同但\n    attention pattern不同，导致不同的activation sparsity distribution。KL的gradient coupling\n    property是loss function的数学性质，与architecture无关——只要model有SwiGLU FFN且sparsity 在hidden\n    states上操作，KL就能捕获joint interactions。因此KL优势在Mistral上同方向复现。 PPL increase 50%（vs Llama的50.3%）高度一致。Gap绝对值（4.64\n    vs 9.44）较小是因为 Mistral的dense PPL更低（5.48 vs 6.12），两个model的relative gap pattern一致。\n    Sliding window attention可能使某些layers的neuron importance更localized，略微 降低BCE+comp的absolute\n    PPL（12.86 vs Llama的18.64），但不改变KL dominance。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 10: Mistral-7B-v0.3 Cross-Architecture Validation'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Wiki PPL↓\n    - ARC-c↑\n    - MMLU↑\n    rows:\n    - - Dense\n      - 5.48\n      - 58.1\n      - 62.8\n    - - KL-only\n      - 8.22±0.10\n      - 56.4\n      - 61.3\n    - - BCE+comp\n      - 12.86±0.29\n      - 50.8\n      - 55.9\n    - - Gap (KL vs BCE+comp)\n      - −4.64\n      - '+5.6'\n      - '+5.4'\n  - name: 'Table 10b: Cross-Architecture Consistency'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Llama 3.1 8B\n    - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n    rows:\n    - - KL PPL increase vs dense\n      - 50.3%\n      - 50.0%\n    - - KL vs BCE+comp gap (PPL)\n      - 9.44\n      - 4.64\n    - - KL vs BCE+comp gap (%)\n      - 50.6%\n      - 36.1%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Side-by-side bar chart: Llama和Mistral的KL-only vs BCE+comp PPL，展示cross-architecture\n    consistency'\n  analysis: 'Mistral-7B-v0.3成功复现KL dominance：KL-only (8.22) vs BCE+comp (12.86)，gap\n    36%。 KL PPL increase vs dense（50%）与Llama（50.3%）惊人一致，证明KL的优势是loss function 的universal\n    property而非architecture-specific artifact。排除reviewer concern \"Single model / limited\n    generalization\"。\n\n    '\n- name: LongBench Long-Context Evaluation\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: 'LongBench English subset（4K-32K tokens），所有conditions。 Per-task-type\n    breakdown: single-doc QA, multi-doc QA, summarization, few-shot, code。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    dense_longbench_avg: 43.5\n    teal_longbench_avg: 35.4\n    wina_longbench_avg: 33.8\n    rsparse_longbench_avg: 34.6\n    spon_longbench_avg: 39.8\n    bce_comp_longbench_avg: 32.1\n    kl_only_longbench_avg: 42.1\n    spon_kl_longbench_avg: 42.8\n    kl_single_doc_qa: 44.8\n    kl_multi_doc_qa: 38.2\n    kl_summarization: 42.5\n    kl_few_shot: 47.1\n    kl_code: 38.0\n    bce_comp_single_doc_qa: 35.2\n    bce_comp_multi_doc_qa: 28.4\n    bce_comp_summarization: 33.8\n    bce_comp_few_shot: 34.6\n    bce_comp_code: 28.5\n    dense_single_doc_qa: 46.2\n    dense_multi_doc_qa: 39.5\n    dense_summarization: 43.8\n    dense_few_shot: 48.3\n    dense_code: 39.6\n    kl_only_avg_drop_vs_dense: 1.4\n    bce_comp_avg_drop_vs_dense: 11.4\n    kl_worst_task_type: multi-doc QA\n    kl_worst_task_drop: 3.3\n  result_rationale: '长序列evaluation测试predictor是否generalize beyond短训练序列。KL的output-distribution\n    matching objective在长序列下仍然有效，因为它不依赖specific sequence length——predictor 看到的是per-token\n    hidden states，length主要影响attention pattern。KL-only的drop（1.4 avg） 与short-context\n    evaluation一致。Multi-doc QA是最challenging的任务类型（需要cross-document reasoning），因此KL-only在此处drop最大（3.3\n    points）。BCE+comp在长序列下degradation 更严重（11.4 avg drop）——因为BCE的per-neuron error在长序列中accumulates\n    without compensation fully correcting the compounding effect。SPON+KL以42.8接近dense的43.5，\n    进一步确认composition在长序列下仍然有效。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 11: LongBench Per-Task-Type Breakdown'\n    columns:\n    - Task Type\n    - Dense\n    - TEAL\n    - SPON\n    - BCE+comp\n    - KL-only\n    - SPON+KL\n    rows:\n    - - Single-doc QA\n      - 46.2\n      - 38.1\n      - 42.0\n      - 35.2\n      - 44.8\n      - 45.3\n    - - Multi-doc QA\n      - 39.5\n      - 31.2\n      - 36.1\n      - 28.4\n      - 38.2\n      - 38.8\n    - - Summarization\n      - 43.8\n      - 35.8\n      - 40.2\n      - 33.8\n      - 42.5\n      - 43.1\n    - - Few-shot\n      - 48.3\n      - 39.5\n      - 44.3\n      - 34.6\n      - 47.1\n      - 47.8\n    - - Code\n      - 39.6\n      - 32.4\n      - 36.5\n      - 28.5\n      - 38.0\n      - 38.9\n    - - '**Average**'\n      - '**43.5**'\n      - '**35.4**'\n      - '**39.8**'\n      - '**32.1**'\n      - '**42.1**'\n      - '**42.8**'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Radar chart: 5个task types，Dense/KL-only/BCE+comp/SPON+KL四条线，展示KL-only profile近似dense'\n  - 'Heatmap: methods × task types，color by score，直观展示BCE+comp在所有task types上consistently差'\n  analysis: 'LongBench结果证明KL predictor在长序列（4K-32K）下generalization良好（avg drop 1.4），\n    无需长序列finetune。BCE+comp在long-context下进一步恶化（avg drop 11.4 vs short-context的12.8%），\n    可能因为compensation网络对error accumulation的correction在长序列下saturate。 增强了EMNLP venue\n    fit（NLP-specific long-context evaluation）。\n\n    '\n- name: MT-Bench Multi-Turn Instruction Following\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: 'MT-Bench 80题 × 8 categories，GPT-4o judge。测试sparsity对instruction following\n    quality的影响。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    dense_mtbench_avg: 7.21\n    teal_mtbench_avg: 6.18\n    spon_mtbench_avg: 6.78\n    bce_comp_mtbench_avg: 6.42\n    kl_only_mtbench_avg: 7.05\n    spon_kl_mtbench_avg: 7.12\n    kl_writing: 7.35\n    kl_roleplay: 7.15\n    kl_reasoning: 6.65\n    kl_math: 6.55\n    kl_coding: 6.85\n    kl_extraction: 7.45\n    kl_stem: 7.1\n    kl_humanities: 7.3\n    bce_comp_writing: 6.8\n    bce_comp_reasoning: 5.85\n    bce_comp_math: 5.65\n    bce_comp_coding: 5.9\n  result_rationale: 'MT-Bench测试multi-turn instruction following——一个对output quality高度敏感的setting。\n    KL-only（7.05）与dense（7.21）差距仅0.16（GPT-4o judge的scoring granularity内）， 说明KL的output\n    distribution matching直接保留了instruction following能力。 Math和reasoning categories drop略大（KL-only\n    6.55/6.65 vs dense ~6.8/6.85），因为 这些tasks需要precise multi-step reasoning，对任何distribution\n    shift更敏感。 BCE+comp（6.42）在reasoning-heavy categories下degradation严重（5.85/5.65），因为\n    BCE的imprecise sparsity mask在需要所有neurons correctly participate的reasoning chain上\n    产生compounding errors，compensation无法fully recover。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 12: MT-Bench Results'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Avg Score\n    - Writing\n    - Reasoning\n    - Math\n    - Coding\n    rows:\n    - - Dense\n      - 7.21\n      - 7.5\n      - 6.85\n      - 6.8\n      - 7.1\n    - - TEAL\n      - 6.18\n      - 6.45\n      - 5.6\n      - 5.4\n      - 5.8\n    - - SPON\n      - 6.78\n      - 7.1\n      - 6.35\n      - 6.15\n      - 6.55\n    - - BCE+comp\n      - 6.42\n      - 6.8\n      - 5.85\n      - 5.65\n      - 5.9\n    - - KL-only\n      - 7.05\n      - 7.35\n      - 6.65\n      - 6.55\n      - 6.85\n    - - SPON+KL\n      - 7.12\n      - 7.4\n      - 6.75\n      - 6.65\n      - 6.95\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar chart per category: Dense vs KL-only vs BCE+comp，8个categories并排'\n  analysis: 'MT-Bench进一步确认KL-only在generation quality上接近dense。GPT-4o judge评分差异 KL-only\n    vs dense仅0.16——在judge的noise floor以内。BCE+comp在math/reasoning上 severe degradation（-1.15/-1.00\n    vs dense），而KL-only仅-0.25/-0.20。 Strengthens EMNLP NLP evaluation story。\n\n    '\n- name: RULER Synthetic Long-Context Diagnostics\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: 'RULER synthetic evaluation at 4K and 16K context，3 representative\n    task types (needle-in-a-haystack, multi-key retrieval, variable tracking)。 Fine-grained\n    diagnostics complementing LongBench。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    dense_ruler_4k_avg: 95.2\n    kl_only_ruler_4k_avg: 93.8\n    bce_comp_ruler_4k_avg: 87.4\n    spon_kl_ruler_4k_avg: 94.5\n    dense_ruler_16k_avg: 88.5\n    kl_only_ruler_16k_avg: 86.1\n    bce_comp_ruler_16k_avg: 78.3\n    spon_kl_ruler_16k_avg: 87.2\n    kl_needle_4k: 98.0\n    kl_needle_16k: 94.5\n    kl_multikey_4k: 91.2\n    kl_multikey_16k: 82.4\n    kl_vartrack_4k: 92.1\n    kl_vartrack_16k: 81.3\n    bce_comp_needle_4k: 94.5\n    bce_comp_needle_16k: 86.2\n    bce_comp_multikey_4k: 83.8\n    bce_comp_multikey_16k: 72.1\n    bce_comp_vartrack_4k: 83.9\n    bce_comp_vartrack_16k: 76.5\n    kl_only_4k_to_16k_drop: 7.7\n    bce_comp_4k_to_16k_drop: 9.1\n    dense_4k_to_16k_drop: 6.7\n  result_rationale: 'RULER的synthetic tasks提供controlled diagnostics——每个task isolate一种capability\n    (retrieval precision, multi-hop tracking等)。KL-only在4K下接近dense（93.8 vs 95.2）， 在16K下gracefully\n    degrade（86.1 vs 88.5）——4K→16K drop (7.7)接近dense pattern (6.7)， 说明KL predictor不会随context\n    length引入额外的degradation。BCE+comp的4K→16K drop更大 (9.1)，在multi-key retrieval（需要同时attend\n    to多个scattered positions）和variable tracking（需要maintain state across distance）上degradation尤其严重——因为这些tasks\n    对sparse mask quality最敏感，BCE的imprecise masks在长距离dependency上compounding。 Needle-in-a-haystack是最简单的task（单点retrieval），所有methods都表现好。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 13: RULER Synthetic Evaluation'\n    columns:\n    - Task\n    - Context\n    - Dense\n    - KL-only\n    - BCE+comp\n    - SPON+KL\n    rows:\n    - - Needle\n      - 4K\n      - 99.2\n      - 98.0\n      - 94.5\n      - 98.5\n    - - Needle\n      - 16K\n      - 96.8\n      - 94.5\n      - 86.2\n      - 95.8\n    - - Multi-key\n      - 4K\n      - 93.5\n      - 91.2\n      - 83.8\n      - 92.4\n    - - Multi-key\n      - 16K\n      - 84.1\n      - 82.4\n      - 72.1\n      - 83.5\n    - - Var-track\n      - 4K\n      - 92.8\n      - 92.1\n      - 83.9\n      - 92.5\n    - - Var-track\n      - 16K\n      - 84.5\n      - 81.3\n      - 76.5\n      - 83.2\n    - - '**Average**'\n      - '**4K**'\n      - '**95.2**'\n      - '**93.8**'\n      - '**87.4**'\n      - '**94.5**'\n    - - '**Average**'\n      - '**16K**'\n      - '**88.5**'\n      - '**86.1**'\n      - '**78.3**'\n      - '**87.2**'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: x=context length (4K, 16K), y=RULER avg accuracy, 每个method一条线，展示degradation\n    rate'\n  - 'Heatmap: task × method × context length，诊断哪些capabilities被sparsity影响最大'\n  analysis: RULER诊断补充LongBench：KL-only的context-length degradation pattern与dense一致\n    (4K→16K drop差仅1 point)，而BCE+comp多drop 2.4 points。Multi-key retrieval 是differentiation最大的task（KL\n    82.4 vs BCE+comp 72.1 at 16K），这与理论一致—— multi-key需要FFN准确处理多个simultaneously relevant\n    positions，joint neuron interaction quality直接影响结果。\n","numLines":1182,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1182}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01JYzXSqhCABMGYjw1BtCc7W","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've now read both the PDF paper and the review context YAML. Let me analyze what I have:\n\n**Paper**: \"Output-Distribution Distillation Makes Compensation Networks Obsolete for SwiGLU Activation Sparsity\"\n\n**Key claims**:\n1. KL-trained contextual sparsity predictors categorically dominate BCE+compensation (9.20 vs 18.64 PPL)\n2. Modular decomposition c = c_s + c_θ(x) combining SPON + KL achieves 7.98 PPL with 6.8% interaction residual\n\n\n3. The quality gap between KL and BCE approaches scales quadratically with sparsity levels\n\nThe paper includes a comprehensive experimental evaluation across twelve sections with extensive ablations—starting with four-condition baselines, then validating the SPON method, testing the KL-BCE composition, running full benchmark comparisons, sweeping across sparsity ranges, and extending to cross-architecture validation with Mistral.\n\nAll twelve planned experiments from the review checklist are covered, so I'm confident the experimental scope is complete. Now I'll set up two parallel reviewers—one focusing on methods and experimental rigor, the other on novelty and positioning relative to prior work—then run them through a structured roundtable process to synthesize their findings.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":42893,"cache_read_input_tokens":22952,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":42893},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"be4af677-c918-498a-8593-19b0dadd846b","uuid":"609cf55c-2160-49f0-a82c-10fed87a65b4"}
