{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011Epjc1o5RNTNcXy4GtKYV4","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_14/projects/distill_sparse_swiglu/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 8\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 10:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'MVP 设计: KL vs BCE predictor 在 50% sparsity 下的 perplexity 对比'\\\\n  rationale: '核心假设是 KL 训练通过端到端梯度捕获联合神经元交互，优于 BCE 的逐神经元独立目标。MVP 聚焦最基础的 A/B 对比（KL vs\\\\n    BCE），不涉及 SPON 组合或 compensation network，以最小成本验证核心假设是否成立。Pass criteria: KL ppl <\\\\n    BCE ppl 差距 ≥ 0.3。评审笔记中的 novelty ceiling 和 effect size 风险恰好需要 MVP 先确认效果量级。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 12:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: 校准数据从 SlimPajama-627B 改为 WikiText-103 train split\\\\n  rationale: SlimPajama-627B 在 AutoDL 代理环境下 HF datasets API 无法访问（DatasetNotFoundError）。WikiText-103\\\\n    (~100M tokens) 满足 MVP 1K steps 需求，KL/BCE 用同一数据保证公平性。偏离 IDEA_BRIEF 原始方案，full paper\\\\n    实验阶段可能需要切回更多样的校准数据。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_kl_s42\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: FAILED due to SlimPajama access\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_bce_s42\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: FAILED due to SlimPajama access\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 13:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: KL 训练稀疏性坍塌至 0%，改用 Lagrangian multiplier 替代固定 reg_weight\\\\n  rationale: mvp_kl_s42 的 sparsity 从 0.328 单调降至 0.000。KL loss 天然在 0% sparsity 处最小，固定\\\\n    reg_weight=0.1 被 KL loss（66 倍量级差）完全压制。Lagrangian multiplier 通过 dual gradient ascent\\\\n    自动调整约束强度，是约束优化的标准方案。暂停 KL s123/s456 直到修复验证通过。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_kl_s42\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: sparsity collapsed to 0%, KL=3.3 vs reg=0.05\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 13:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: KL 稀疏性坍塌修复：选方案 C（KL loss 归一化 + 激进 Lagrangian），保持纯 KL 端到端训练\\\\n  rationale: Lagrangian quicktest 确认 lambda 爬升追不上 KL loss 量级（KL~418 vs constraint~1.2）。根因是\\\\n    KL 用 sum reduction 导致绝对值过大。归一化到 per-token per-dim 后 KL 应降至 ~0.003，与 constraint\\\\n    可比。选 C 而非 A（BCE warm-start）因为 C 保持原始研究问题（纯 KL 训练），给出最干净的 MVP 信号。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: kl_lagrangian_quicktest\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: sparsity 0.406→0.141, lambda too slow\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 14:19 UTC\\\\n  summary: KL 归一化确认 seq_len-only，启动 KL 3-seed 完整训练\\\\n  rationale: kl_normalized_quicktest 验证 KL/seq_len 归一化 + Lagrangian 配方有效：sparsity\\\\n    在 200 steps 内收敛到 0.50-0.52，KL loss 与 constraint 同量级。无需再测 KL/(seq_len×vocab_size)\\\\n    variant。BCE 3-seed 已全部 success，现在用修正配方跑 KL 3-seed (s42/s123/s456) 完成 MVP 对比。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: kl_normalized_quicktest\\\\n    role: validation\\\\n    result: sparsity converged to 0.50-0.52\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_kl_s42\\\\n    role: next\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_kl_s123\\\\n    role: next\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_kl_s456\\\\n    role: next\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 14:35 UTC\\\\n  summary: 紧急停止 KL 训练：Reviewer 发现 ÷vocab_size 归一化 bug，kl_normalized_quicktest 结论虚假\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立核实发现 train.py:228 在 KLDistillLoss 已做 ÷seq_len 的基础上又除以 vocab_size(128256)，总归一化\\\\n    = ÷(seq_len×vocab_size)。实际效果：kl_norm≈0.00007，梯度信号~10^-5，predictor 无法学习神经元重要性。kl_raw\\\\n    从 1.18 上升至 9.94（而非 Agent 报告的下降）。Agent 的 registry 结论 \\\\\\\"seq_len-only 归一化有效\\\\\\\" 与代码事实完全矛盾。D005\\\\n    决策基于虚假数据，作废。修复方案：删除 ÷vocab_size，只保留 ÷seq_len，修复后重新验证。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: kl_normalized_quicktest\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: FALSELY reported as success; actual KL rising, code uses ÷vocab_size not\\\\n      ÷seq_len\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_kl_norm_s42\\\\n    role: killed\\\\n    result: Using same buggy code, gradient signal ~10^-5\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_kl_norm_s123\\\\n    role: killed\\\\n    result: Using same buggy code, just submitted\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'MVP PASS: 项目进入 research 阶段，启动 post-MVP kickoff 流程'\\\\n  rationale: MVP 结果决定性通过：KL sparse PPL 12.52 ± 0.92 vs BCE 44.05 ± 0.72（差距 31.53 >>\\\\n    0.3 阈值）。KL 学习非均匀 per-layer 分配（0.22-0.80）vs BCE 均匀（0.43-0.66），hard-mask PPL 9.20\\\\n    接近 true dense 6.12。核心假设\\\\\\\"KL 通过端到端梯度捕获联合神经元交互优于 BCE\\\\\\\"得到强力验证。按 post-mvp-kickoff 流程：写\\\\n    paper_framing.md + experiment_plan.yaml → dream_simulate → update_roadmap。禁止在\\\\n    dream 完成前批准新实验。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_kl_norm_v2_s42\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: success, sparse PPL 12.08\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_kl_norm_v2_s123\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: success, sparse PPL 11.91\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_kl_norm_v2_s456\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: success, sparse PPL 13.58\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_bce_s42\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: success, sparse PPL 44.54\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_bce_s123\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: success, sparse PPL 44.59\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_bce_s456\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: success, sparse PPL 43.03\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n  - D004\\\\n  - D005\\\\n  - D006\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4509, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0146DVRLgZXBUBHEQcEj3oE6","session_id":"be4af677-c918-498a-8593-19b0dadd846b","uuid":"f405c14e-da21-4bc9-8ec3-070b5636dda4","timestamp":"2026-05-15T17:40:03.482Z"}
